<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">Iyoobe Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iyoobe Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Iyoobe Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Iyo</para>
  <para style="mt1">Iyoobe Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyoobe maxaafan nuni be7iza taarikey wolqqama metoynne qohoy iza bolla gakkida issi suure asa gishshas qonccisees. He addezikka ba naytanne ba haaro ubbaafe mela atoyssafeka bollara iita madunth madunxidi waayettees; hessafe guye ginxo malan heedzdzuto shiiqida haasayan Iyoobinne iza laggeti ha iita waayisiza metozan baas seetettiza yo7oza qoncciseettes; wurseththankka Xoossi Iyoobes qonccisides.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyoobe laggeti iza bolla gakkida waayeza gishshas kase bantti eriza haymanote wogappe dendidi banttas diza dumma dumma qofa shiishsheettes; hessika, «Xoossi kiya; asas lo7o woga immees; iita as gidikko qaxxayees» geettes. «Hessaththoka Iyoobe ha ubba metoy gakkiday izi nagara ooththida gishshas gidontta aggenna» geettes. Iyoobe gidikko iza bolla wosoy bayndaadenne suure as gidida gishshas hayssa mala wolqqama qixaatey izas bessenna. Iyoobe mala suure asa bolla hayssa mala wolqqama metoy gakkidayssi birshettontta maaleththo gidides. Ha ubbaa metozan Iyoobe ammanoy yaanne haa qaaxxontta aggikokka tuma pirdiza Xoossay likke pirda izas immidi iza gakkida metozappe kessana malanne kase de7oza izas zaarana mala Xoossa minnidi woosappenne oyshoppe guye gibeenna.</para>
  <para style="ip">Xoossi Iyoobe iza oychchida oyshatas zaaro maarara maarara immontta aggikokka Iyoobes diza mino ammanoza nashshidi Xoossi ba wolqqanne ba erateththaa malalisiza ogera ginxon izas qonccisides. Hessafe guye Iyoobi Xoossi bayranne era gididayssa shaakki erides. Xoossa Xoossateththa shaakki eridaappe guye kase izi hanqon kumidi kessida deexo qaalata gishshas yeellatidi maaroteththan gelides.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maxaafaas wurseththa shemppoy Iyoobi bana gakkida metozappe zaaro demmidi kase de7ozan simmidayssanne qasseka haaro baggara kaseyssafe haa aadho demmidayssa qonccisees. Hara baggara qasse Iyoobe bolla gakkida metoy ay gaason iza bolla gakkidaakkon Iyoobe laggetas gelontta gishshas Xoossay istta minththi seerides.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lose gidida dumma dumma haymanote wogatappe Xoossi ba baggara bayra gididayssa Iyoobi xalala erida gishshas ba laggeta gishshas woossides; Xoossika iza woosaa siyides. Xoossi Iyoobes wurseththa de7oza koyroyssafe aaththi lo7eththides.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyoobe gakkida metota <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 1:1-2:13">1:1—2:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyoobi ba yeleta gallassa qanggides <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 3:1-26">3:1-26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Koyro yuusho haasaya <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 4:1-14:22">4:1—14:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nam7anththo yuusho haasaya <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 15:1-21:34">15:1—21:34</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Heedzdzanththo yuusho haasaya <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 22:1-26:14">22:1—26:14</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyoobes wurseththa haasaya <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 27:1-31:40">27:1—31:40</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Eelihu haasaya <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 32:1-37:24">32:1—37:24</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossi koyro yuusho haasayda haasaya <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 38:1-39:30">38:1—39:30</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nam7anththo yuusho Xoossa haasayanne Iyoobe zaaro <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 40:1-42:6">40:1—42:6</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossi Iyoobes zaaro immidi anjjides <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 42:7-17">42:7-17</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobe Bolla Gakkida Paace</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1"/>Uuxe geetettiza deren issi Iyoobe geetettiza asi dees. Izikka iita ubbaafe haakkidaade; wosoy iza bolla bayndaade; Xoossas yayyizaadenne suure asa. <verse eid="JOB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2"/>Izas laappun attuma naytinne heedzdzu macca nayti deettes. <verse eid="JOB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3"/>Haaro baggarakka izas 7,000 dorsati, 3,000 gaamellati, 500 waaththa booratinne 500 hareti deettes; qasseka keehi daro aylleti deettes. Arshey mokkizaso baggara iza mala durenne gita asi haray deenna.<verse eid="JOB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4"/>Iyoobe attuma nayti issoy issoy bason taran taran diggisa giigsidi issife shiiqi ufayetteettes; heedzdzu michchetakka banttako xeygisidi isttara issife meettessinne uyeettes. <verse eid="JOB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5"/>Diggisa gallassati aadhdhidaappe guye Iyoobi wonttara dendidi ba nayta xeygisidinne issaa issaa sunththan yarsho shiishshees. Izi hessaththo ooththizay, «Ta nayti geelli gidaa Xoossa cayidi awukkora nagara ooththidaakkonne!» guussa hirgan nayta nagarappe geeshshanaas giidi ooththees. Iyoobi hayssa yarsho woga qanxxontta ubba wode ooththees.<verse eid="JOB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6"/>Gallassatappe issi gallas salo kiitanchchati GODAA sinth shiiqida wode Xala7eykka isttara issife shiiqides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:2">Medhe 6:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7"/>Xoossika, «Awappe yadii?» giidi Xala7e oychchides. Xala7eykka, «Sa7a gaxa ubbaa yaanne haa yuuyerettada yadis» giidi GODAAS zaarides.<verse eid="JOB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8"/>GODAY Xala7eza, «Ta aylleza Iyoobe lo7eththa beyadii? Iza mala ammanettidanne suure as biitta bolla beettibeenna; izi iita ubbaafe haakkidi taas yayyiza suure asa» gides.<verse eid="JOB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9"/>Xala7eykka zaaridi, «Iyoobi nees Xoossaas coo yayyizee? <verse eid="JOB 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10"/>Izi nees yayyizay neni izanne iza nayta, izas diza haaro ubbaa lo7eththa naagida gishshassa; izi ooththiza oosoza kumeth anjjida gishshassinne daro wude meheta ne izas immida gishshas gidennee? <verse eid="JOB 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11"/>Ane ne kushe yeddada izas dizayssa ubbaa ne dhayssidaakko tuma izi nena qonccen cayana» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:10">Ajju 12:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12"/>GODAYKKA Xala7es, «Ero ane Iyoobe bolla issi metokka gaththofa attiin izas diza haaroza bolla ne koyidaazi ooththanawu dandayaasa» gides. Hessafe guye Xala7ey Xoossa sinththafe ke7idi bides.<verse eid="JOB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobe Nayta Hayqonne Iza Haaro Dhayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13"/>Gallassatappe issi gallas Iyoobe nayti bayra ishason wuri shiiqidi miidinne woyne cajje uyidi ufayetteettes. <verse eid="JOB 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14"/>He gallas issoy kiitetti yiidi, «Nuni boorata waaxidi goyishin; haretikka nu mata demban heemettishin, <verse eid="JOB 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15"/>Saaba dere asati yiidi nu bolla ola denththidi ubbaaka di7i ekki bida; ne aylleta ubbatakka mashshan wodhida; tani xalala attada hanida ubbaa nees yootanaas yadis» gides.<verse eid="JOB 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16"/>Koyro kiitanchchay ba haasayza haasaya buro ongontta dishin nam7anththo kiitanchchay yiidi, «Dorsatanne heemmiza heenththanchcha ubbaa wolqqanth saloppe wodhdhidi wodhides; tani xalla attada hanida ubbaa nees yootanaas yadis» gides.<verse eid="JOB 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17"/>Hayssa kiitanchchay haasayi ongontta hara kiitanchchay yiidi, «Heedzdzu butten shaakettida bonqqiza Kaladaawe asati yiidi qoppontta dishin nu bolla iita meto gaththida; gaamellata ubbaa di7i efichchida; ne aylleta ubbaa mashshan wodhida; tani xalla attada hanida miish ubbaa nees yootanaas yadis» gides.<verse eid="JOB 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18"/>Hayssa ha kiitanchchay haasayi ongontta hara kiitanchchay yiidi, «Ne nayti ubbatikka banttas bayra ishason shiiqidi mishenne woyne cajje uyishe ufayettiza. <verse eid="JOB 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19"/>Bazzofe yida gote carkoy qoppontta dishin yiidi keeththa kumeth shirechchi yeggides; keeththazikka istta bolla wodhdhiin wurikka hayqqida; tani xalla attada hanida miish ubbaa nees yootanaas yadis» gides.<verse eid="JOB 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20"/>Hessafe guye Iyoobi dendidi kayottidi ba may7oza daakkides; ba hu7e bulusides; biittan gufanni goynnides. <verse eid="JOB 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21"/>«Tani ta aayey uloppe kallo yelettadis; hayqqiza wodekka kallo baana; GODAY immides; GODAY ekkides; GODAA sunththi galatettidaaz gido» gides.<verse eid="JOB 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22"/>Ha paacey ubbay Iyoobe bolla gakkinkka izi ubbaaka nagara ooththibeenna; Xoossa bollaka camo qaala kessibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Qasseka Iyoobe Gakkida Paace</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1"/>Gallassatappe issi gallas salo kiitanchchati Xoossa sinth shiiqiza wode Xala7eykka isttara issife shiiqides.<verse eid="JOB 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2"/>GODAYKKA, «Awappe yadii?» giidi Xala7e oychchides. Xala7eykka, «Biitta ubbaa bolla yaanne haa simerettada yadis» gides.<verse eid="JOB 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3"/>GODAYKKA Xala7e, «Ta aylleza Iyoobe lo7eththa beyadii? Iza mala ammanettidaynne kiya as biitta bolla beettenna; izi iita ubbaafe haakkidi taas yayyiza suure asa; iza dhayssanaas ne dandayana mala ta nees aaththa immana mala ne tana denththeththiday hadanna. Beya Iyoobi gidikko hanno gakkanaas ba suureteththan minni eqqides» gides.<verse eid="JOB 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4"/>Xala7eykka, «Galba gishshas galba»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Galba gishshas galba gizayssi tal7e woykko kushe zaaro gididayssa qonccisees.</char></note> gizayssa mala «Asi ba asho ashshanaas gishe baas dizayssa ubbaa immees. <verse eid="JOB 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5"/>Ha7i gidikko ne kushe iza bolla miccada izas kumeththa asateththa bolla qoho ne gaththidaakko tuma nena qonccera cayana» gides. <verse eid="JOB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6"/>GODAYKKA Xala7eza, «Ane lo7o; wodho wodhoppa attiin iza bolla ne koyidayssa ooththanaas dandayaasa» gides.<verse eid="JOB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7"/>Hessafe guye Xala7ey Xoossa sinththafe ke7idi Iyoobes hu7e binanappe doommidi toho xugunth gakkanawu wolqqama madunththan waayettana mala ooththides. <verse eid="JOB 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8"/>Hessafe dendidayssan Iyoobi bidinththa bolla uttidi ba madunththa kon7an qaach doommides.<verse eid="JOB 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9"/>Iyoobes machcheya, «Ha7ikka Xoossa bolla diza ne ammanozi mino dizee? Xoossa cayada hayqqa!» gadus.<verse eid="JOB 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10"/>Iyoobikka, «Waanada eeya maccassa haasaya haasayay? Xoossi lo7o miish immiza wode ufayssan ekkoos; ha7i gidikko iita izi nu bolla ehishin iza bolla zuuzumanaas bessizee?» gides. Iyoobi ha ubbaa metoynne waayey iza bolla gakkinkka izi Xoossa bolla iita miish haasaydi nagara ooththibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobe Lagge Heedzdzata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11"/>Temaane dere as Elfaaze, Shuha dere as Belidaadinne Na7imaane dere as Zoofaare geetettiza heedzdzu laggeti Iyoobes deettes. Isttika Iyoobe bolla gakkida metoza siyida wode izas istti qadhettoyssa qonccisanaassinne iza minththeththanaas bantta dereppe xeygettidi issife Iyoobekko yida. <verse eid="JOB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12"/>Buro haakora yishin Iyoobe be7ida; gido attiin izi Iyoobe gididayssa shaakki eranaas dandaybeettenna. Isttas wozinay meqqiin izas mishettidi bantta may7oza daakkida; gudullaza ekkidi pude salo laallida; bantta hu7enkka makkidi addafe waassidi yeeho doommida. <verse eid="JOB 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13"/>Izas waayeza daraa be7ida gishshas aykko haasayontta izara laappun gallassanne laappun omars biitta bolla uttidi gam7ida.<verse eid="JOB 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobi Ba Yelettida Gallas Qanggeth</para>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobe Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1"/>Hayssafe guye Iyoobi haasaya doommides; ba yelettida gallassaa,<verse eid="JOB 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2-3"/>«Tani ta aayey ulon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:2-3">medhettida omarsayanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:2-3">tani yelettida gallassaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:2-3">qanggettidayta gidetto!<verse eid="JOB 3:2-3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4"/>He gallassay dhuman laametto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">Salo Xoossay iza qoppofo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">Poo7oy mulekka izan beettofo.<verse eid="JOB 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5"/>Shaarumaninne girdi gida dhuman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">kamettidayssa gido;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">shaaray kammiin dhumay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">iza poo7o mitto.<verse eid="JOB 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6"/>He gallassa omarsayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">girdi gida dhumay kammo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">layththa gallassatara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">issife taybettofo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">aginata qoodan geli qofettofo.<verse eid="JOB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7"/>He gallassa omarsay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:7">aykkoy bayndaaz gido;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:7">ufayssa qaalaykka izan seetettofo.<verse eid="JOB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8"/>Lewataane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lewataane geetettizayssi beni woden haylasho misatiza gita do7akko.</char></note> geetettiza do7a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">qaaseththanaas dandayzayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">gallassata qanggizayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">he gallassayo qanggetto.<verse eid="JOB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9"/>He gallassa omars</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">bakkale xoolintteti dhumetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">poo7o hidotay izan beettofo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">wontta xalqqey izan xalqqofo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1-9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:14-18">Er 20:14-18</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10"/>Ta ayfetappe meto genththana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">ta aayey ulo ta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">gordontta aggida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">he gallassay qanggettidayssa gido.<verse eid="JOB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11"/>«Ta aayey ulon dashe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">haaththe gida attidaakko aazee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">Ta aayey uloppe ke7ida mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">ays hayqqabeekkinaa?<verse eid="JOB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12"/>Gulbateti tana mokki ekkanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:12">dhanththatikka tana dhanththanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:12">ays beettidoo?<verse eid="JOB 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13"/>Ha7i tani saron ichchidaakko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:13">dhiskadakka shemppo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:13">demmanakkoshin.<verse eid="JOB 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14"/>Ha7i laaletti beettizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:14">baas keexxida biitta kawotaranne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:14">zorizaytara ta dhiskada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:14">shemppo demmanakkoshin.<verse eid="JOB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15"/>Ba keeththa worqqaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:15">biran kunththida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:15">daannatara ta issife</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:15">shempanakkoshin.<verse eid="JOB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16"/>Qasseka ays biitta garsan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">moogettida awucaya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">woykko issi gallassa poo7o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">mulekka be7ontta naa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">ays gidabeekkinaa?<verse eid="JOB 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17"/>Heen iitata waayisoy attana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:17">daabursiza ooson</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:17">de7idayti shempana.<verse eid="JOB 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18"/>Qashetti diza asatikka saro demmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:18">bana oosisiza asata hanqo qaala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:18">siyanayssafekka attana.<verse eid="JOB 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19"/>Laafatinne gita asati issife beettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">aylletikka heen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">ba godatappe wozzettana.<verse eid="JOB 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20"/>«Xoossi un7o bolla dizaytas poo7o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">duussazi camo qofan kumidaades</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">de7o ays immizee?<verse eid="JOB 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21"/>Hayqo laamotizaytassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">qotetti diza aqoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">aaththi koyidi demmonttaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">de7o ays immizee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:6">Ajju 9:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22"/>Duge duufon gelishe ufayettizaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:22">de7oy ays imettizee?<verse eid="JOB 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23"/>Izi biza ogey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">izaadefe geemettidaadessinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">Xoossi gordi woththida asas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">poo7oy ays imettizee?<verse eid="JOB 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24"/>Yeehoy taas kath gidides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:24">waasoykka taas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:24">goggiza haaththa mala gidides.<verse eid="JOB 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25"/>Ta yayyida miish ta bolla yides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:25">ta dagammidayssika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:25">ta bolla gakkides.<verse eid="JOB 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26"/>Ta giddon hirgay xalla diza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:26">saroy, woppaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:26">shemppoy deenna» gi qanggides.<verse eid="JOB 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Elfaazey Koyro Haasayda Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1"/>Temaane dere as Elfaazey hizgi zaarides;<verse eid="JOB 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2"/>«Iyoobee! Issi asi ne bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">wolqqaththi haasaykko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">izaade ne dandayan ezganee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">Haasayanaappe attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">ooni agganee?<verse eid="JOB 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3"/>Neni daro asata tamaarsadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:3">daaburda qesetakka minththadasa.<verse eid="JOB 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4"/>Kase ne qaalati dhuphettizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:4">maaddeetteskoshin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:4">neni kokkoriza gulbatetakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:4">minththaasakkoshin.<verse eid="JOB 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5"/>Ha7i gidikko metoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">ne bolla gakkida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">hidotay bayndaade gidadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">metoykka ne bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">minnida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">hidota qanxxadasa.<verse eid="JOB 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6"/>Xoossaas ne yayyiza yashshay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">ammanththizaaz gidennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">Ne suure ogetikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">nees hidotata deettennee?<verse eid="JOB 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7"/>Xillo as gidi dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">iza metoy gakkidaadey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">suure as gidi dishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">tim7i gi dhaydaadey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">diikko ane qoppa.<verse eid="JOB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8"/>Tani akeekida mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">iitateth goyidi meto zerizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">heytantti ba ooththooro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">shiishshana.<verse eid="JOB 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9"/>Istti Xoossa peenon dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:9">iza hanqo dambalan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:9">istti dippi gi dhayana.<verse eid="JOB 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10"/>Iitati gaammo mala xaaggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">ba qaala dhoqqu ooththidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">waassana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">Xoossi gidikko isttas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">achchaa menththereththana.<verse eid="JOB 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11"/>Gaammoy shankkatidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">mizaaz dhayda wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">hayqqiza mala isttika hayqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">gaammo maratikka laalettiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">istta naytikka laalettana;<verse eid="JOB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12"/>Gallassafe issi gallas xuura gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">kiitay taakko yides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">hessa he kiitaza saasukeththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">ta siyadis.<verse eid="JOB 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13"/>Asay omars wolqqama dhisko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:13">seerida wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:13">tana iita agumoy agunththides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:15">Iyo 33:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14"/>Baboynne kokkorsi tana oykkiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:14">taas meqeththati ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:14">kokkorana mala ooththides.<verse eid="JOB 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15"/>Ayanay ta sinththara aadhdhides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:15">dagamappe dendidayssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:15">ta hasay eqqides.<verse eid="JOB 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16"/>Heenkka issi miishshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">eqqi dizayssa beyadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">tishshi ooththa xeelladis shin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">izi aazakko shaakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">eranawu dandayabeekke.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">Hessafe guye co7u gidasohoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">hizgiza qaala siyadis,<verse eid="JOB 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17"/>‹Xoossa sinththan xillo gidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">beettanaas dandayza asi dizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">woykko bana medhdhidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">geeshsha asi beettanee?<verse eid="JOB 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18"/>Xoossi baas ooththizaytan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">ammanettontta aggiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">ba kiitanchchata bollaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">izi mooro miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">demmizaaz gidikko,<verse eid="JOB 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19"/>histtiin haradhdhoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">montta dishin laalettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">istta yochchay biittafe gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">urqqafe oosettida keeththa giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">dizayta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">waani ammanettanee?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olath geetetizayssi issi issi bagga gamoththo qaalan haradhdho geetettees.</char></note><verse eid="JOB 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20"/>Maaladoppenne omarsafe giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">istti meqerettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">erettontta dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">istti mernaaskka dhayana.<verse eid="JOB 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21"/>Tole dhishkey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">shodettichchida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">dunkaane mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">istti erateththi baynda hayqqana.›<verse eid="JOB 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1"/>«Iyoobee! Ne xeygiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">nees koyanaadey diikko xeyga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">nees maado immana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">kiitanchchatappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">awayssako xeellay?<verse eid="JOB 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2"/>Eeya as yiilloy wodhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:2">qanaateykka as dhayssana.<verse eid="JOB 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3"/>Eeya asi minnidi dishin beyadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:3">gido attiin iza aqoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:3">qoppontta dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:3">Xoossa hanqon laalettides.<verse eid="JOB 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4"/>Iza naytikka ba de7ozas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">ammanththizaaz demmettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">dubbushankka istta gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">haasayza as</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">istti demmontta gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">istta bolla qohoy gakkana.<verse eid="JOB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5"/>Izi zerida kaththaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">koshattida asati maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">haray attiin agunththa giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">mokkidayssaka izas ashshettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">Saametti uttida asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">iza haaroza ekkanaas amotteettes.<verse eid="JOB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6"/>Metoy coo biittafe dendenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:6">waayeykka gadeppe coo kezenna.<verse eid="JOB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7"/>Tama finxeththi bonqofe dendidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:7">pude finxiza mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:7">asikka waayes yelettees.<verse eid="JOB 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8"/>«Tani nena gididaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:8">Xoossa woossana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:8">ta meto ubbaa izas qonccisana.<verse eid="JOB 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9"/>Izi qooday baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">malalisiza miish,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">pilggiin gakettontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">gita miish ooththees.<verse eid="JOB 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10"/>Biitta bolla ira bukisees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:10">goshshatakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:10">haaththan shugisees.<verse eid="JOB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11"/>Kawuyidayta bonchchon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">dhoqqu histtees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">muuzottizayta minththeththidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">ufayssees.<verse eid="JOB 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12"/>Istta oosoy polettontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:12">gene asata qofa hada ooththees.<verse eid="JOB 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13"/>Cinccata istta gene oosozan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">zaari oykkees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">Gene asata qofaakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">eesora dhayssees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:19">1Qoro 3:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14"/>Gallassay isttas dhuma gidees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:14">buro seeta gallassan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:14">omars dhuma giddon diza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:14">istti tattafettana.<verse eid="JOB 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15"/>Manqota istta morkketa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">mashshafe ashshees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">metotanchchatakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">waayisizayta kusheppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">kessi ekkees.<verse eid="JOB 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16"/>Manqotas hidota immees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:16">makkallateththika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:16">biitta bollafe dhayssees.<verse eid="JOB 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17"/>«Xoossi seeriza asi anjjettidayssa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:17">hessa gishshas Ubbaa Dandayza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:17">Xoossa seera leqqofa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:11">Leemi 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:5-6">Ib 12:5-6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18"/>Xoossi madunththikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">zaaridi paththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">izi menththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">ba kushen zaaridi koolees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:1">Hose 6:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19"/>Usuppun qommo boshappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:19">nena ashshi ekkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:19">laappunththazanka ay qohoykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:19">ne bolla gakkenna.<verse eid="JOB 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20"/>Kosha layththan izi nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:20">shemppora paxa woththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:20">ola layththankka izi nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:20">hayqoppe ashshana.<verse eid="JOB 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21"/>Xoossi nena iita</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">inxarsafe naagana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">boshay ne bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">yiikkoka yayyaka.<verse eid="JOB 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22"/>Wolqqamata qohoynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:22">koshay nena daganththenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:22">biitta do7ataska ne yayyaka.<verse eid="JOB 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23"/>Ne goyiza gaden nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:23">shuchchi waayisenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:23">do7atarakka ne saron daana.<verse eid="JOB 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24"/>Ne keeththan saroy kumanayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">ne shaakka erana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">ne mehe xeellishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">aqoppe paccenna.<verse eid="JOB 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25"/>Ne zereththay daranayssa ne erana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:25">ne zereththayka demban diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:25">maata mala darana.<verse eid="JOB 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26"/>Kaththi kaxxidi maxettizayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:26">nekka lo7eththa cimmada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:26">duufon baana.<verse eid="JOB 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27"/>Nuni hayssa ubbaa pilggidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">tumu gididayssa eridos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">nenikka akeekada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">hayssa ooson peysha.»<verse eid="JOB 5:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobe Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1"/>Hayssafe guye Iyoobi hizgi zaarides;<verse eid="JOB 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2"/>«Ta muuzoteththi geeddaretti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">uttidaakko aazee dizay!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">ta metoy ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">geeddaran geeddaretti uttidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">aazee dizay!<verse eid="JOB 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3"/>Abba lanqen diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">aceppe aadhdhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">deexxanakkoshin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">hessa gishshas dandayay paccida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">ta haasayay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">nena malalisanaas bessenna.<verse eid="JOB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4"/>Ubbaa dandayza Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">tana ba yiishshatan caddides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">istta marzetikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">ta asateththa giddon laalettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">daganththiza Xoossa boshay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">ta yuushon yuuyi aadhdhides.<verse eid="JOB 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5"/>Tumappe hardiday cilila maata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:5">demmidi caaggi erizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:5">Booraykka basso maata demmiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:5">xaaggi erizee?<verse eid="JOB 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6"/>Maxiney gelontta mal7ontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:6">kaththi meetettizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:6">Phuuphphulle haaththi mal7izee?<verse eid="JOB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7"/>Hayssa mala kath</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:7">maanaas koykke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:7">muusi attiin kushenkka bochchike.<verse eid="JOB 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8"/>«Ta amottizayssa Xoossi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">taas immidaakko aazee dizay!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">Izi ta waaso siyidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">aazee dizay!<verse eid="JOB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9"/>Hayssa ubbaafe izas shene gidiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">izi tana menththereththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">yeggizaakko!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">Ba kusheza yeddidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">izi tana dhayssidaakko!<verse eid="JOB 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10"/>Shempo immontta ay hargey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">tana sakkikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">tani ufayssan guppana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">tani Geeshshaza qaala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">ay wodenkka kaddabeekke;<verse eid="JOB 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11"/>«De7on de7ana mala dandayza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">ay minoteththi taas dizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">Hidotay baynda aggiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">ays de7azinaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12"/>Tani shuchcha mala minoo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:12">Ta asateththayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:12">xarqimalaththo minoo?<verse eid="JOB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13"/>Tana maaddanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">taas aykko wolqqay deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">taas diza wolqqay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">ubbay eketichchides.<verse eid="JOB 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14"/>«Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:14">yash aggidaadessinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:14">daaburdaadeska iza laggey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:14">izas kiyateth bessanaas koshshees.<verse eid="JOB 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15"/>Ta ishati gidikko haroy harotti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">wodhidaappe guye meliza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">ammanththontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">shaafata mala baleththizayta.<verse eid="JOB 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16"/>Shaafatan balgo balgo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:16">shachchi kumees.<verse eid="JOB 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17"/>Bone aginatan gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">maayi dhayees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">shaafatikka haaththi baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">melata gideettes.<verse eid="JOB 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18"/>Caana meheta laaggi ogera biza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">asati haath koshshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">ogeppe ke7i bazzo biitta gelidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">toylu toylishe dhayeettes.<verse eid="JOB 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19"/>Teema biittafe biza mandara asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">haaththe koyeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">Saaba dere zal7anchchatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">haaththe demmanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">hidota ooththeettes.<verse eid="JOB 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20"/>Banti ammanetti uttida shaafati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">melidayssa be7idi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">hidota qanxxeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">haaththaako gakkiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">yiilloteettes.<verse eid="JOB 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21"/>Intteka taas hayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">ha shaafata mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">ta bolla gakkida metoza be7idi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">gede guye baqatideta.<verse eid="JOB 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22"/>Histtiin ta inttena hessa woykko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">hayssa taas immite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">woykko intte haarozappe kessidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">tana ashshite gadinaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23"/>Qasse ta morkketa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">kusheppe tana ashshite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">woykko tana waayisizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">kusheppe tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">kessi ekkite gadinaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24"/>«Tana tamaarsite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:24">tanikka co7u gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:24">ta moorozakka tana bessite.<verse eid="JOB 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25"/>Tuma qaalay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">camo gidikkoka ekettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">intte walassay gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">aykkoska go7enna.<verse eid="JOB 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26"/>Intte ta haasaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">carko mala qoodeeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">histtiko hidota qanxxida taas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">zaaro immanaas ays koyeetii?<verse eid="JOB 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27"/>Yi7o nayta bolla saama yeggeeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:27">intte intte siiqo laggeta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:27">bayzanaas miishshan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:27">marshetteetii?<verse eid="JOB 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28"/>«Ane tana haa xeellite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:28">intte sinththan ta wordotadinaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29"/>Inttes qoho gidontta mala simmite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:29">tani likke asakko!<verse eid="JOB 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30"/>Tumukka ta inxarsan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">qohoy beettanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">Ta doonaykka gene miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">shaakki eranaas dandayennee?<verse eid="JOB 6:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1"/>«Asas biitta duussay baaxe duus deennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:1">Isttas gallassayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:1">une ooththiza oosanchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:1">gallassa mala gidennee?<verse eid="JOB 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2"/>Isttika kuwa garsan shempanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">amottiza oosanchchatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">ba damoza ekkanaas naagiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">une asa mala gidettennee?<verse eid="JOB 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3"/>Ta daaburda aginati taas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">go7ay bayndayta gidida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">meto omarsatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">taas qofa omars gidida.<verse eid="JOB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4"/>Ichchiza wode awude</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">dendandinaasha gaada qoppays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">omarsayka gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">taas gede aduqqees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">tanikka wonttana gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">haa hee shirettashe aqays.<verse eid="JOB 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5"/>Taas kumeththa asateththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">guxunen kumides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">taas ashoykka madunxi goggides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">taas madunththayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">dhuuqqidi uzazees.<verse eid="JOB 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6"/>Ta layththata gallassati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">daththa mooqe xongeththafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">eesoteettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">issi hidotay baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">wurseth gakkeettes.<verse eid="JOB 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7"/>Ta Godawu! Ta shemppoya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">peeno mala gididayssa qoppa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">hayssafe guye ubbaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">lo7o miish demmike.<verse eid="JOB 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8"/>Ha7i tana be7izayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">nam7anththo zaaridi beyenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">izi koyzaa gidikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">tana demmanawu dandayenna.<verse eid="JOB 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9"/>Shaaray laaletti dhayzayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:9">hayqqidi duufon biza asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:9">haa simmidi yeenna.<verse eid="JOB 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10"/>Nam7anththo zaaridi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">baso simmenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">izaade erizayti ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">iza balettana.<verse eid="JOB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11"/>«Hayssafe guye co7u giikke!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">Taas ayanay ceecidayssafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">dendidayssan ta haasayays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">ta shemppoya irayettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">gishshas zuuzumays.<verse eid="JOB 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12"/>Hayssa likke naagettizaade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">ne tana ooththiday tani abbayee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">Woykko abba giddon diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">do7aayee?<verse eid="JOB 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13"/>Ta hiixay tana minththeththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">ta ichchizasoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">ta sakoza baleththees</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">gaada ta qoppadis.<verse eid="JOB 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14"/>Neni gidikko tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:14">agumon yashissaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:14">ajjuutankka daganththaasa.<verse eid="JOB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15"/>Hayssa metoy darida asateththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">tookkada daanaappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">ta cuuletta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">hayqqanayssa doorays.<verse eid="JOB 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16"/>Hidota qanxxadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">daanaaska ta koykke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">taas layththayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">qaanth gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">tana aggaaga.<verse eid="JOB 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17"/>«Ne soho immanaassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:17">qoppanaas asi aazee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:4">Maza 8:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 14:3">14:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18"/>Wonttan wonttan pilggana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:18">woden wodenkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:18">ne paaccana mala asi aazee?<verse eid="JOB 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19"/>Cuch mittiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:19">guuththa wodekka taas immikii?<verse eid="JOB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20"/>Asa kaalettiza Godawu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">Tani nagara ooththoyssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">neni ay qohettadii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">Ays ta bolla ne toora zaaradii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">Ays hayssa keena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">ta nena deexxadinaa?<verse eid="JOB 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21"/>Ubbaaka ta nagara atto giikkii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">Ta ooththiza qoho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">taappe diggikii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">Ta duufon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">gelana wodey gakkides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">hayssafe guye ne tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">koyidaakkoka ta beettike.»<verse eid="JOB 7:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Belidaade Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1"/>Shuha dere as Belidaade geetettizayssi hizgidi zaarides;<verse eid="JOB 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2"/>«Ne doonappe ke7iza qaalati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">gote carko mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">awude gakkanaas hayssaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">ne haasayanee?<verse eid="JOB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3"/>Xoossi pirda bokkasi erizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:3">Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:3">xilloteth bokkasi erizee?<verse eid="JOB 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4"/>Ne nayti Xoossa qohidaa gidikko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:4">istti bantta pirda ekkida guussa.<verse eid="JOB 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5"/>Gidikkoka ne Xoossako simmiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:5">Ubbaa Dandayza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:5">Xoossa woossiko,<verse eid="JOB 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6"/>suurenne geesh gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">izi eesoti nees bessiza sohon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">nena zaarana.<verse eid="JOB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7"/>Ne doomeththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:7">guuth misatikkoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:7">nees poloy keehi lo7o gidana.<verse eid="JOB 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8"/>«Ane kase yeleta oychcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:8">kase aawati gakkidasoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:8">pilgga xeella.<verse eid="JOB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9"/>Nu layththazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">buro guuth gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">nuni aykkoka erokko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">nu layththayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">eesho mala aadhdhizaaza.<verse eid="JOB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10"/>Istti nees tamaarsizayssinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:10">nees yootizayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:10">ba akeekizayssafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:10">ekkidi gidennee?<verse eid="JOB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11"/>Tumukka carey bayndason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">shacca maatay mokki erizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">Haaththi bayndason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">marcoy cililizee?<verse eid="JOB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12"/>Hayssi hanontta aggiko diccidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:12">buuch gakkanaappe sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:12">buro cililan dishe melees.<verse eid="JOB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13"/>Xoossa dogiza asata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">ubbaa wurseththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">hessa mala hanana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">Xoossi baawa giza asata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">hidotay qanxxettana.<verse eid="JOB 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14"/>Achcharo keeththa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:14">miishshan ammanetteettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:14">istti hidota ooththiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:14">miishshi diikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:14">kawushshara dhayana.<verse eid="JOB 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15"/>Achcharo keeththa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">istti zemppizaa gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">izi minni eqqenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">achcharo keeththaza izi oykkiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">duuxeretti wodhdhana.<verse eid="JOB 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16"/>Haaththa kallida harumay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:16">ho7o demmidi daayees;<verse eid="JOB 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17"/>Xaphoza shuchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:17">muuhe giddon yeddees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:17">zaalla za7an xaphees.<verse eid="JOB 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18"/>Ba dizasoppe shodettiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:18">izi dizasozi erettenna.<verse eid="JOB 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19"/>Iza wurseththi hessa mala gidees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:19">hara maatati biittafe doleettes.<verse eid="JOB 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20"/>«Xoossi wosoy baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:20">asata olenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:20">iita asata qese minththenna.<verse eid="JOB 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21"/>Hessa gishshas nenikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:21">ufayssan miiccana malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:21">‹Ililana› mala izi ooththana.<verse eid="JOB 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22"/>Nena ixxiza asati gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:22">yeella may7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:22">iita asata keeththika dhayana.»<verse eid="JOB 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobe Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1"/>Iyoobi hizgi zaarides;<verse eid="JOB 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2"/>«Ee! Tani hayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">tumu gididayssa erays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">gido attiin asi Xoossa sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">waani xillo gidanaas dandayzee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:17">Iyo 4:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3"/>Izarakka ooni marshettanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">dandayzee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">Izi issi shii oyshota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">oychchizaa gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">isttafe issinokka zaaranaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">dandayzaadey deenna.<verse eid="JOB 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4"/>Xoossi eranchchanne wolqqama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:4">oonee izara eqettidi xoonettonttay?<verse eid="JOB 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5"/>Akeekontta zumata kokkorsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:5">ba hanqozankka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:5">shirechchi yeggana.<verse eid="JOB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6"/>Xoossi biitta dizasoppe kokkorsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:6">biitta tuussatakka qaaseththana.<verse eid="JOB 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7"/>Awa arshey mokkontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">ooththanawu dandayees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">Xoolinttetikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">poo7isontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">ooththana.<verse eid="JOB 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8"/>Oonikka maaddontta dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:8">salota micciday iza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:8">izi abba dambala bolla hemettees.<verse eid="JOB 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9"/>Zardo, Ooriyoninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">Piliyaadise geetettiza Xoolintteta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">qasseka duge baggara diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">daro Xoolintteta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">salo bolla medhdhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">woththiday Xoossa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:31">Iyo 38:31</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:8">Amo 5:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10"/>Izi ooththiza malalisiza miishshata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">nuni pilggidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">akeekanawu dandayokko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">izi poliza makkalla miishshata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">nuni qoodanawu dandayokko.<verse eid="JOB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11"/>«Xoossi ta matara aadhdhikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">ta demmike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">haa taakko shiiqikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">shaakkada erikke.<verse eid="JOB 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12"/>Izi ba koyidayssa ekkiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">oonikka iza diggenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">‹Ays hayssaththo ooththay?› giidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">iza oychchanaas xalizay deenna.<verse eid="JOB 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13"/>Xoossay ba hanqozappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">guye simmenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">Era7aabe geetettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">abba giddo do7ata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">maaddizaytikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">iza toho garsan gulbatana.<verse eid="JOB 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14"/>«Histtiin tani izas zaaro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">waana immana dandayazinaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">Izara marshettanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">ay qaala ta demmanee?<verse eid="JOB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15"/>Geesh gida ta beettidaakkoka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">ta bolla pirdizaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">tana maarana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">woossana attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">izas zaaro immanaas xalikke.<verse eid="JOB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16"/>Ta iza sunththa xeygikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:16">izi zaaro taas immizaa gidikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:16">ta magana izi siyana gaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:16">ta ammanettike.<verse eid="JOB 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17"/>Izi tana gote carkon liiqisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:17">aykko gaasoykka baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:17">taas madunththaa ha darsana.<verse eid="JOB 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18"/>Shempo ta zaarana wodey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">gakkanaaska</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">taas shemppo immenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">ta shemppon waaye kunththides.<verse eid="JOB 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19"/>Taas diza wolqqan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">ta izara baaxetana gontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">wolqqan izara eqettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">dandayanay deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">ta mootettada iza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">laththana gontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">iza pirdiza asataakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">shiishshanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">dandayza asi deenna.<verse eid="JOB 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20"/>Tani geeshshinne xillokoshin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">ta haasayay tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">qohanchcha kessees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">ta haasayza haasayati ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">ta bolla pirdeettes.<verse eid="JOB 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21"/>«Aykkoka tani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">borey bayndaade gidikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">ta gishshas qoppike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">ta shemppoyokka harassetays.<verse eid="JOB 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22"/>Xoossi xillozanne qohanchchazakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">dhayssiza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">aykko dummateththika deenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">ta giday hessa gishshassa.<verse eid="JOB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23"/>Asi iita meton wurshin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:23">izi geeshsha asa meto qidhees.<verse eid="JOB 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24"/>Biittay iita asata kushen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">aadhdhi imettishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">izi pirdiza asata ayfe goozees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">hayssa ooththiday Xoossa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">gidontta aggiko haray oonee?<verse eid="JOB 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25"/>«Ta layththati woxxizaytappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">haa aadhdhi eesoteettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">aykko ufayssika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">ta demmontta aadhdheettes.<verse eid="JOB 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26"/>Isttika sookke gizayssafe oosettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">wogolo mala eesoteettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">baqqi ekkiza golle kafo mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">eesoteettes.<verse eid="JOB 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27"/>Tani ta zuuzunththaa balana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:27">‹Ta sinththaaka kareththo aggada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:27">ane poo7isa bessays› giikko,<verse eid="JOB 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28"/>Xoossi tana geesh ooththidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">qoodonttayssa tani eriza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">metoynne waayey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">ta bolla gakkana gaada yayyays.<verse eid="JOB 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29"/>Histtiin ta qohanchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:29">geetetta qoodettidaa gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:29">taas hada daaburay aazassee?<verse eid="JOB 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30"/>Tani ta asateththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">saamunan meeccizaa gidikko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">ta kushezakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">keeha geeshshizaa gidikko,<verse eid="JOB 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31"/>ha ubbaa ooththiinkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:31">neni duge iita ciimman tana olana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:31">ta may7otikka tana shaatettana.<verse eid="JOB 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32"/>Izi ta mala as gidontta gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">pirdiza asataakko biidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">pirdettoos gaanawu dandaykke.<verse eid="JOB 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33"/>Nu bolla ba kusheza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:33">gaththi woththidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:33">pirdi nuna shaakkiza asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:33">nu giddon dizaakko,<verse eid="JOB 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34"/>iza teemateththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">tana hirgisontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">Xoossi ba guufeza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">ta bollafe denththidaakko,<verse eid="JOB 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35"/>tani izas yayyontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:35">haasayanakkoshin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:35">ha7i gidikko ta diza hanon dashe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:35">haasayana dandaykke.<verse eid="JOB 9:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1"/>«Duussi tana saleththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">ta de7iza camo de7oza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">qonccen sissana.<verse eid="JOB 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2"/>Tani Xoossa hizgana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">ta bolla nees lancey diikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">taas qonccisa attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">ta bolla pirdofa!<verse eid="JOB 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3"/>Hayssa likke ne tana metoththoyssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">nees wogaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">Neni nerkka medhdhida asaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">ne kadhanaas nees bessizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">Iita asata duulatay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">nena ufayssizee?<verse eid="JOB 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4"/>Ne ayfey asa ayfe malaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:4">Woykko ne asaththo xeellay?<verse eid="JOB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5"/>Ne wodeti asayssa malaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:5">Woykko ne layththati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:5">asa layththa mala qaanththee?<verse eid="JOB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6"/>Ays ne ta qohoza xeellay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:6">Ays ne ta nagarakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:6">kaalla kaallada aggontta ixxay?<verse eid="JOB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7"/>Tani qohonttayssanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:7">ne kusheppe oonikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:7">tana ashshonttayssa ne eraasa.<verse eid="JOB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8"/>Taas medhanne mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">immi medhdhiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">ne kusheta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">histtiin ha7i ha kusheti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">tana zaari laalli dhayssanee?<verse eid="JOB 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9"/>Mana miishsha mala ne tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">biittafe medhdhoyssa qoppa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">histtiin ha7i ne tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">gudulla mala liiqisanee?<verse eid="JOB 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10"/>Tana maaththa mala tigada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:10">meqo maaththa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:10">irkkisa ooththadasa.<verse eid="JOB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11"/>Ta asateththa galbaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">ashon kammadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">meqeththaninne shayan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">gaththa oyththadasa.<verse eid="JOB 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12"/>De7onne mernaa siiqo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">taas immadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">ne naagoykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">ta ayana minththides.<verse eid="JOB 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13"/>«Hekko hayta ha miishshata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">ne wozinan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">qotta woththada daasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">ne qofaykka hayssa gididayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">ta eradis.<verse eid="JOB 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14"/>Ta qohidaa gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">ne ayfeti beyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">ta nagara gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">tana qaxxayontta aadhdhaka.<verse eid="JOB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15"/>Ta nagara ooththidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">eesora meto giddon kundana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">lo7o miish ooththidaa gidikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">galatetikke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">ta gilqiin yeellay tana gakkides.<verse eid="JOB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16"/>Ta otorettidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">ne tana gaammo mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">shankkatada oykkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">ne tana qohanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">zaara zaara shankkatana.<verse eid="JOB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17"/>Ta bolla markkattiza asata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">ne ubbaa gallas demmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">ta bolla ne hanqoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">gede dari dari baana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">neni tana qohanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">ubba gallas ooraththa qofata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">ola asata mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">ta bolla denththaasa.<verse eid="JOB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18"/>«Ta Godaa Xoossawu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">Ays ta yelettana mala ooththadii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">Oonikka tana be7ontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">ta hayqqaychchidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">lo7okkoshin!<verse eid="JOB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19"/>Ta medhettontta attarkina;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">tani ta aayey uloppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">duufon bidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">taas lo7o gidanakkoshin!<verse eid="JOB 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20"/>Ta daana layththaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">qaanth gidekkee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">he qaanththa layththayn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">guuththara ta ufayettana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">tana aggarkkii!<verse eid="JOB 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21"/>Hessika tani nam7anththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">haa simmanaas dandayontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">girdi gida dhumaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">baanaappe sinththana.<verse eid="JOB 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22"/>Ta baanaasozi dhuma kuwaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">shiroy kumida biitta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">heen diza poo7ozi dhuma mala.»<verse eid="JOB 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Zoofaare Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1"/>Na7imaane dere as Zoofaarey hizgides;<verse eid="JOB 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2"/>«Hayssa ha hada qaalatas ubbaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">zaaro immizay baye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">Asi haasaya daron</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">xillo gidana dandayzee?<verse eid="JOB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3"/>Iyoobee! Ne haasayda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">hada haasayatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">zaaroy imettontta misatizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">Ne hayssa mala qilccishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">nena seerana asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">bayndaz misatizee?<verse eid="JOB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4"/>Ne qofan, ‹Tani xillo› gaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:4">Xoossaska, ‹Ne sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:4">tani geeshsha› gaasa.<verse eid="JOB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5"/>Xoossi nees haasaydaakkonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:5">likke zaaro immidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:5">aazee dizay!<verse eid="JOB 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6"/>Erateththas ogey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">daro gidida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">Xoossay nees erateththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">xuura qonccisidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">aazee dizay!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">Hessa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">Xoossi nena qaxxayizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">nees bessizayssafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">guuththara gididayssa era.<verse eid="JOB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7"/>«Neni Xoossas ciimma gidida xuura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">eranaas dandayay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">pilggada gakkanawu dandayay?<verse eid="JOB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8"/>Iza gitateththay saloppe bolla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">neni ay ooththanawu dandayay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">Iza ciimmateththayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">si7ooleppeka ziqqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">neni ay eray?<verse eid="JOB 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9"/>Xoossa gitateththay biittafe darees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:9">abbafe aakkees.<verse eid="JOB 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10"/>Xoossi yiidi qachchiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">gede pirda keeth shiishshidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">oonee iza digganay?<verse eid="JOB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11"/>Xoossi go7ontta asata erees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:11">izi qoho beyishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:11">co7u giidi xeellenna.<verse eid="JOB 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12"/>Eeya asi eranchcha gidanaappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:12">harey as gididi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:12">yelettanayssi kawuyana;<verse eid="JOB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13"/>Gidikkoka neni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">ne wozina suurisikko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">ne kusheza miccada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">pude Xoossako woossiko,<verse eid="JOB 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14"/>Neni nagarappe haakkiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">iita miishshika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">neson beettontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">ne ooththiko,<verse eid="JOB 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15"/>he wode dhoqqu gaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">yeellay baynda ubbaa miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">ne beyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">yeellay baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">minna eqqanawu dandayaasa.<verse eid="JOB 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16"/>Ne metoza ubbaa ne dogana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:16">ne akeekizaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:16">aadhdhi bichchida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:16">haro haaththa mala gidana.<verse eid="JOB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17"/>Ne shemppoya seeta gallassa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">awappe aadhdhada poo7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">dhumaykka wontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">poo7o mala gidana.<verse eid="JOB 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18"/>Nees hidotay diza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">nenikka ammanettada daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">Xoossi nena naagiza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">neni hirgay baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">woppu gaada daana.<verse eid="JOB 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19"/>Ne oonaska babbontta ichchana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:19">daro asatikka ne sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:19">bonchcho demmanaas koyana.<verse eid="JOB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20"/>Iitata ayfey qooqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">istti attana ogeti ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">gorda gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">istta wurseththayka hayqo.»<verse eid="JOB 11:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobe Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1"/>Iyoobi hizgi zaarides;<verse eid="JOB 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2"/>«Tumukka intte keehi eranchchata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">intte hayqqishinkka erateththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">inttenara issife hayqqana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">misatees.<verse eid="JOB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3"/>Gido attiin taaska intteyssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">akeekay dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">tani inttefe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">ay miishshankka guuxxike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">intte haasaydayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">asi ubbay erees.<verse eid="JOB 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4"/>«Ta Xoossa xeygiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">taas izi zaarida wodey dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">ha7i tani ta laggetas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">qidhes gidadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">mooroy baynda xillo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">tani asa ubbaas qidhes attadis.<verse eid="JOB 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5"/>Metoy iza bolla gakkontta asa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">matan metotida asa meto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">leqqanayssi kawushsha miishsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">gido attiin kundanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">gandigarzaade sugi yeggeeta.<verse eid="JOB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6"/>Ba eeqa xoossata goynnizayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">kaysotinne xoossa kaddida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">asatikka saron deettes.<verse eid="JOB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7"/>«Gidikkoka medosata oychcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">istti nena tamaarsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">salo kafota oychcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">istti nees yootana.<verse eid="JOB 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8"/>Woykko biittays yoota;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">izakka nena tamaarsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">abba giddo moletikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">nees yootana.<verse eid="JOB 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9"/>Hayssa ubbaa giddofe Xoossa kushey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:9">hayssa ooththidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:9">eronttay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10"/>Shemppora paxa diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:10">medheteththi ubbaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:10">issi issi asa shemppoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:10">Xoossa maata giddon dees.<verse eid="JOB 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11"/>Inxarsi kaththa qaana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">shaakki erizayssa mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">hayththika haasaya qommota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">shaakki erees.<verse eid="JOB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12"/>Erateththay cimateththan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:12">akeekaykka layththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:12">adussateththan beetteettes.<verse eid="JOB 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13"/>«Xoossas gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">aadho erateththinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">wolqqay dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">zoreynne akeekay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">iza matappe beetteettes.<verse eid="JOB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14"/>Xoossi laallidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">oonikka zaari keexxanawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">dandayenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">Xoossi qachchidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">oonikka birshanawu dandayenna.<verse eid="JOB 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15"/>Xoossi ira diggiko kosha gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">ira bukisikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">qasse biittay haron meecettana.<verse eid="JOB 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16"/>Xoossi minonne xoonizaade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">balettizaadeynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">baleththizaadey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">nam7atikka iza godateththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">garsanna.<verse eid="JOB 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17"/>Izi zorizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">erateth diggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">dere kaaleththizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">izi eeya ooththana.<verse eid="JOB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18"/>Izi kawota kawoteththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:18">araataappe woththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:18">qasho asa mala dancco birshisana.<verse eid="JOB 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19"/>Qeesetappe istta qeeseteththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">woththi ekkidi istta gooddana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">godateththa bolla dizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">istta godateththafe diggana.<verse eid="JOB 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20"/>Ammanettida asata co7u ooththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:20">cimatappeka akeeka diggana.<verse eid="JOB 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21"/>Gita asata yeellachchana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:21">wolqqamata wolqqa diggana.<verse eid="JOB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22"/>Dhumason qotettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">xuura qonccisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">sakkanna dhuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">poo7on laammana.<verse eid="JOB 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23"/>Kawotakka gitasana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">zaaridikka dhayssana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">kawoteththaaka darsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">zaaridikka laallana.<verse eid="JOB 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24"/>Kaaleththizaytas akeekay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">paccana malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">ogey baynda bazzo biittan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">toylattana mala izi ooththana.<verse eid="JOB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25"/>Poo7oy baynda dhumason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:25">istti dhuphettana malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:25">maththottida asa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:25">istti gadigadana mala ooththana.<verse eid="JOB 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1"/>«Hekko hayssa ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:1">ta ayfey be7ides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:1">ta hayththika siyidi akeekides.<verse eid="JOB 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2"/>Intte erizayssa keena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">tanikka erays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">ta aykkonka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">inttefe guuxxike.<verse eid="JOB 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3"/>Gidikkoka ta haasayay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">ubbaa dandayza Xoossara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">ta izarakka marshettana.<verse eid="JOB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4"/>Intte gidikko wordon kumideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">oonakka paththanawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">dandayontta aakimeta mala.<verse eid="JOB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5"/>Hayssa ubbaafe intte co7u gidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:5">eranchchata misati beettanakkoshin!<verse eid="JOB 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6"/>Tani shiishshiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">marshe qaala siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">ta qohokka tani yootishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">co7u giidi ezgite.<verse eid="JOB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7"/>Xoossa sunththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:7">ays wordo haasayeetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:7">baleththon intte Xoossa ufayssana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:7">inttes misatizee?<verse eid="JOB 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8"/>Iza bessontta ogera maaddeetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:8">Izas xabaqa eqqandetii?<verse eid="JOB 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9"/>Xoossi inttena qoridaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">issi lo7o miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">inttefe demmandeshaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">Intte asata eeysizayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">Xoossaka eeyssanawu dandayana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">inttes misatizee?<verse eid="JOB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10"/>Intte geemara wordo maaddiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:10">tumappe Xoossi inttena hanqana.<verse eid="JOB 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11"/>Iza bonchchoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">inttena yashshennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">Iza teemaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">inttena daganththennee?<verse eid="JOB 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12"/>Intte leemison haasayza haasayati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">bidinththa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">go7ay bayndayta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">intte marsheteththayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">mana miishsha mala meqerettana.<verse eid="JOB 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13"/>Ane co7u giite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">Tani haasayana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">taas gisha immite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">hessafe guye ba dosoyssa hano.<verse eid="JOB 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14"/>«Tani ach saxxada gencecashe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:14">dizay aazassee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:14">Ta shemppoyakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:14">ta kushen dawus.<verse eid="JOB 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15"/>Hessa gishshas Xoossi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">tana wodhana koykkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">taappe attiza miishshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">aykkoyka deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">gidikkoka ta hanoza izas erisana.<verse eid="JOB 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16"/>Nagaranchcha asi Xoossa sinththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">shiiqanaas dandayontta gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">oonee erizay hayssi ta xalateththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">paxanaas gaaso gidanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">dandayees.<verse eid="JOB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17"/>Ane ta haasayza qaalata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">wogara ezgite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">ta doonara ta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">markkattizayssa siyite.<verse eid="JOB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18"/>Ta marsheteththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">lo7eththa giigsada shiishshadis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">izi taas pirdanayssaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">ta erays.<verse eid="JOB 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19"/>Tana mootizay diikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:19">tani marshettontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:19">co7u gaada hayqqana.<verse eid="JOB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20"/>«Godawu! Ta ne sinththafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">qotettontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">heyta nam7u miishshata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">taas ooththa.<verse eid="JOB 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21"/>Heytikka ne hanqo qeseta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:21">ta bollafe denththa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:21">yashissiza ne taman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:21">tana daganththofa.<verse eid="JOB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22"/>Xoossawu! Koyro ne haasaya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">ta nees zaaro immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">tanikka haasayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">nekka zaaro imma.<verse eid="JOB 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23"/>Ero gido ta ooththida nagaraynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">qohoy ay likkee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">Ane ta moorozanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">ta nagara tana erisa.<verse eid="JOB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24"/>Ne sinththa taappe genththada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:24">tana ne morkke mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:24">aazas qooday?<verse eid="JOB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25"/>Carkoy qoqofiza boncco malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:25">mela happa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:25">ne ays tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:25">yashiseththan goodday?<verse eid="JOB 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26"/>Ta bolla ne xaafida mootoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">keehi camo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">tani yelagateththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">ooththida qohozakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">taas aggabeekka.<verse eid="JOB 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27"/>Ne ta tohota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">durumata giddon qachchadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">ta tanggo ubba wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">ne kaalettaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">ta geedon ne eqqaasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:11">Iyo 33:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28"/>«Hessa gishshas tani wooqqida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">miishsha mala gidada attana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">baday mida may7o malakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">ta dhayana.<verse eid="JOB 13:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1"/>«Asho may7ida asas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:1">layththay qaanththa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:1">hessika meton kumides.<verse eid="JOB 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2"/>Ciishsha mala beettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">heerakka qokkees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">eesho mala daro gam7ontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">heera aadhdhees.<verse eid="JOB 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3"/>Histtiin neni hayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">asa medheteththa kaalettay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">Ne sinththika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">pirdas shiishshanee?<verse eid="JOB 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4"/>Tuna miishshafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:4">geeshsha miish demmanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:4">dandayzaadey oonikka deenna.<verse eid="JOB 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5"/>Asa layththas wodhida zaway dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">asi daana aginatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">ne matan qoodan deettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">nenikka woththida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">layththa zawappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">aadhdhizaadey deenna.<verse eid="JOB 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6"/>Uneti aqizaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">ba ooththana gallassa oosoyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">polidi ufayettiza mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">asikka ba daabura gallassan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">ufayettana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">ne ayfe iza bollafe denththa.<verse eid="JOB 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7"/>Qanxxettida miththa uththaska</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">hidotay dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">nam7anththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">simmi aacanaassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">haggata kessanaas dandayees.<verse eid="JOB 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8"/>Aykkoka xaphoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:8">biitta giddon cimmikokka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:8">anoykka biitta giddon musikko,<verse eid="JOB 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9"/>Irxxa demmiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">nam7anththo aacees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">oorath tokettida miththa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">haggata kessees.<verse eid="JOB 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10"/>Asi gidikko hayqqidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">kase baynda mala hanees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">hayqqidaappe guye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">awan beettanee?<verse eid="JOB 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11"/>Abba haaththi wuriza mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:11">shaafa haaththika meliza mala,<verse eid="JOB 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12"/>asikka hessa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">hayqqidaappe guye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">haa simmenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">saloy aadhdhanaashe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">gakkanaas dendenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">dhiskofekka beeggenna.<verse eid="JOB 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13"/>«Hayqqidayta giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">ne tana qottidaakko aazee dizay!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">Ne hanqozi aadhdhana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">wodey gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">ne tana qottidaakko!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">Qaxaro gallas qachchada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">ne tana qoppidaakko!<verse eid="JOB 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14"/>Asi hayqqidaappe guye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">ashora paxa daanaas dandayzee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">Taas wodey laamettana gakkanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">ta hayssa baaxe layththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">gencca aaththana.<verse eid="JOB 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15"/>He wode neni tana xeygana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">tanikka nees ‹Yee› gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">ne medheta gidida tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">beyanaas ne laamotana.<verse eid="JOB 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16"/>Hekko ha7i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:16">ne ta hemeta kaalettaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:16">gidikkoka ta nagara qoppaka.<verse eid="JOB 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17"/>Ta qohoy karaxiiten xunttettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:17">ta nagarakka ne kammana.<verse eid="JOB 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18"/>«Zumay harottiza malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18">woddiza mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18">zaallayka ba dizasoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18">dhoqallettiza mala,<verse eid="JOB 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19"/>haaththi shuch woocidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">ongiza mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">di7oy biitta meecciza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">nenikka asa hidota dhayssaasa.<verse eid="JOB 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20"/>Ne wolqqay mernaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">izaade bolla minnees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">izikka kase baynda mala hanees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">ne iza medhaka laammada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">ne sinththafe dhayssaasa.<verse eid="JOB 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21"/>Iza nayti bonchcho demmidaakkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:21">izi erenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:21">kawuyizaakokka izi xeellenna.<verse eid="JOB 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22"/>Izas iza asateththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">waayezi siyettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">izikka ba metoza gishshas xalla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">yeekkees.»<verse eid="JOB 14:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Elfaaze Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1"/>Temaane dere as Elfaazey hizgides;<verse eid="JOB 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2"/>«Tumu era asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">carko mala kushen oykettontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">miish haasayi erizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">Iza ulon qohiza qofay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">daanaas bessizee?<verse eid="JOB 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3"/>Era asi aykko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">go7ontta qaalataninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">go7ay baynda haasayan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">marshettizee?<verse eid="JOB 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4"/>Neni Xoossas yayyizayssa aggadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:4">Xoossas bessiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:4">goynnozakka diggaasa.<verse eid="JOB 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5"/>Ne qohanchcha gididayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">ne haasayan erettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">gido attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">cinccateththa haasayan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">kammanaas baaxetaasa.<verse eid="JOB 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6"/>Ne bolla pirdizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">ne doonappe attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">tana gidikke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">ne haasayay nenateththaa qonccisees.<verse eid="JOB 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7"/>«Asappe sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">yelettiday nenee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">Zumati medhettanaappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">sinththan ne yelettadii?<verse eid="JOB 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8"/>Tumu Xoossa xuura siyadii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:8">Asa erateth erizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:8">nena xalla nees misatizee?<verse eid="JOB 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9"/>Nuni erizayssafe dumma miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:9">ne erizayssi aazee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:9">Nu erizayssafe nees qonccida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:9">dumma miishshi aazee?<verse eid="JOB 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10"/>Yeletan ne aawappe cimmiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:10">hu7ey pulumida cimati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:10">qofan nunara deettes.<verse eid="JOB 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11"/>Nu baggara nees yootettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:11">Xoossafe imettida minththeththoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:11">nees gidennee?<verse eid="JOB 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12"/>Nena ne wozinay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:12">ays haraso efizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:12">Ays hanqon dereqa xeellay?<verse eid="JOB 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13"/>Hayssaththo ooson Xoossa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:13">ne ayana denththeththadasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:13">Hayssa mala hanqo qaala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:13">haasayanawu gakkadasa.<verse eid="JOB 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14"/>«Asi geesh gidanaas dandayzee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:14">Asho may7iday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:14">xillanaas dandayzee?<verse eid="JOB 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15"/>Xoossay ba kiitanchchata bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">ammanettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">saloykka iza sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">geesh gidenna.<verse eid="JOB 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16"/>Moorettidaynne tuniday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:16">nagarakka haaththa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:16">uyiza asi ay mala iitaa?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 25:4-6">Iyo 25:4-6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17-18"/>«Istta aawati qottontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17-18">isttas ooththidayssa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17-18">eranchchati qonccisidayssa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17-18">tanikka pilggidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17-18">ta nena erisays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17-18">ta nees yootays.<verse eid="JOB 15:17-18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19"/>Biittaya isttas xalla imettadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:19">imaththatikka istta giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:19">walakettibeettenna.<verse eid="JOB 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20"/>As waayisishe de7iza iita asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:20">ba layththa kumeththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:20">waayettishe daana.<verse eid="JOB 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21"/>Daganththiza giiris izi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">ba hayththan siyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">ubbaa miishshi saro misatidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">izas beettiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">iza dhayssiza miishshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">iza bolla yaana.<verse eid="JOB 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22"/>Izas qaaday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">mashshan hayqo gidida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">dhumappe attana hidotay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">izas deenna.<verse eid="JOB 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23"/>Kafos wora attida kaththa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">izi wora attana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">izi dhayana dhuma gallassay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">izaakko matidayssa izi erees.<verse eid="JOB 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24"/>Metoynne ceecey iza yashshana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:24">olas giigettida kawo mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:24">iza bolla minnana.<verse eid="JOB 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25"/>Hayssi hananay Xoossa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">ba kushe denththida gishshassa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">xalida gishshassa.<verse eid="JOB 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26"/>Izi ba ordenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:26">mino gondalle ekkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:26">Xoossara eqettana kezides.<verse eid="JOB 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27"/>«Iza ayfey moodhen goozettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:27">iza xeessayka ordides.<verse eid="JOB 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28"/>Hayssi ha addezi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">mulera kundidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">dhayda katamatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">laalettanaas matida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">kayssa keeththata giddon dees.<verse eid="JOB 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29"/>Duretenna; iza haaroykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">daro wode gam7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">biitta bollaka aakkenna.<verse eid="JOB 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30"/>Dhumappe atti baanawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">dandayenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">tama lacoy haggata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">melissidayssa malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">ciishshatikka carkon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">qokkida miththa mala gidana.<verse eid="JOB 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31"/>Hada miishshan ammanettishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:31">bana barkka baleththofo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:31">hessankka izi go7ay bayndayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:31">gidi attana.<verse eid="JOB 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32"/>Izi wodey gakkontta dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">uththay meliza malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">haggatikka cililontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">miththa mala hanana.<verse eid="JOB 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33"/>Izi buron kaxxontta dishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">ayfezi qoqofettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">woyne miththa malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">ciishshay qoqofettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">wogara miththa mala gidana.<verse eid="JOB 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34"/>Xoossa Xoossateththa erontta asatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">zereththi de7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">gubbon oosettida keeththatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">taman dippi gi xuugettana.<verse eid="JOB 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35"/>Hayssa mala asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">gene miish qoppeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">metokka medhdheettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">istta wozinaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">baleththon kumides.»<verse eid="JOB 15:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobe Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1"/>Iyoobikka hizgi zaarides;<verse eid="JOB 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2"/>«Tani hayssa mala haasaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:2">daro wode siyadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:2">intte saleththiza zoranchchata.<verse eid="JOB 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3"/>Hayssa intte hada haasayas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">wurseththi bayee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">Hayssa lagge tanara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">marshettana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">inttena denththeththiday aazee?<verse eid="JOB 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4"/>Intte ta sozan gidiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">tani intte sohon gididaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">kadhen tani hu7e qaaththada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">ha7i intte gizayssa ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">intte bolla lo7eththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">haasayanakkoshin.<verse eid="JOB 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5"/>Hessa malakka ta doonan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">inttena minththeththananne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">minththanaas daro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">haasayanakkoshin.<verse eid="JOB 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6"/>«Gido attiin daro haasaykkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">ta hargey haa lo7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">co7u ga dandaykkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">ta waayey taappe kichchenna.<verse eid="JOB 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7"/>Xoossawu! Tana asateththafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:7">kare kessadasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:7">ta dere asaa ubbaa dhayssadasa.<verse eid="JOB 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8"/>Ta asateththay gundoyssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">ta bolla dendidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">neni nagaranchcha giidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">ta bolla markkattees.<verse eid="JOB 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9"/>Xoossi tana hanqidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">ta asateththa qanxxereththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">tana ixxidi ba ach</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">ta bolla garccides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">ta morkkey ba ayfe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">ta bolla maxi kessides.<verse eid="JOB 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10"/>Asay ta yuushon shiiqettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">ta bolla ceeqettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">tana qidhe qaalan baqqida.<verse eid="JOB 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11"/>Xoossi tana iita asatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">aaththi immides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">makkallanchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">kushen yeggides.<verse eid="JOB 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12"/>Ta saron daysikoshin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">gidikkoka Xoossi ba hanqozan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">tana menththereththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">ta qoodhe cuulli oykkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">daaburissides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">ba qofa ta bolla polides.<verse eid="JOB 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13"/>Wondafanchchati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">tana giddoththida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">qadheteththi baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">ta kilahota qanxxereththida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">ta ciyezakka biitta bolla gussida.<verse eid="JOB 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14"/>Izi tana zaari zaari madunxides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:14">mino olanchcha mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:14">ziizimi yiidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:14">tana shocides.<verse eid="JOB 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15"/>«Ta kayoteththas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:15">maaqa sikka may7adis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:15">gudulla bolla gufannadis.<verse eid="JOB 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16"/>Ta ayfesoy yekon zo7ides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:16">sakkanna dhumay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:16">ta siphinth kammides.<verse eid="JOB 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17"/>Hayssi ubbay hanshin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">ta ooththida qohoy deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">tani ta woosa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">Xoossako shiishshizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">wozina geeshshateththanna.<verse eid="JOB 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18"/>«Biittazoo! Tana gakkida qohoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">ne kammofa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">Suure pirda gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">ta shiishshiza maganay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">kametti attana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">ne ooththofa!<verse eid="JOB 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19"/>Hekko taas markkattizaadeynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:19">afakaato eqqizaadey salon dees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:25">Iyo 19:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20"/>Ta laggeti tana leqon xeelleettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:20">tani gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:20">pude Xoossas yeekkays.<verse eid="JOB 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21"/>As asara gaththi haasayssidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">maqayinththizaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">dizayssa mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">as Xoossara gaththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">maqayinththiza asi didaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">aazee dizay?<verse eid="JOB 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22"/>«Ta layththas wurseththay gakkees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:22">ta haa simma yonttaso baanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:22">guuththa wodey xalla attides.<verse eid="JOB 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1"/>«Ta ayanay daaburdes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">ta daana layththayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">polettanawu matides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">duufoykka tana naagees.<verse eid="JOB 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2"/>Tana qidhizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:2">tana yuuyi aadhdhida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:2">ta ayfeykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:2">istti ixxizayssa xeellees.<verse eid="JOB 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3"/>Ta Xoossawu! Neeppe attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">taas eqqanay haray deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">neni ne hu7era taas waase gida.<verse eid="JOB 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4"/>Istti pilggidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">akeekanawu dandayontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">istta qofa gordadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">hessa gishshas istti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">xoonana mala ooththofa.<verse eid="JOB 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5"/>Miishshe demmanawu giidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">ba laggeza aaththi immiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">asa nayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">bolla gomey gakkana.<verse eid="JOB 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6"/>«Xoossi tana asas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:6">kaassa miish ooththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:6">asay izaade bolla cuttiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:6">asa mala gidadis.<verse eid="JOB 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7"/>Afunththafe dendidayssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">ta ayfeti doljumida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">kumeththa ta asateththayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">eesho mala gidides.<verse eid="JOB 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8"/>Xillo asati hayssan dagamettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">geeshshati Xoossa ammanontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">asata bolla hanqettida.<verse eid="JOB 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9"/>Gido attiin xilloti tuma ogeppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">kare ke7ettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">geeshshati minoteththa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">minoteththi gujettees.<verse eid="JOB 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10"/>«Intte ubbayka nam7anththo yiidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">ta sinththan marshettiko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">intte giddofe issi akeekara diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">as demmike.<verse eid="JOB 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11"/>Ta layththay wurides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">ta qofaynne taas wozina amoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">hada gidi attides.<verse eid="JOB 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12"/>Hayti ha asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">omarsa gallas geettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">poo7oza qasse dhumana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">hanees geettes.<verse eid="JOB 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13"/>Hayssafe guye taas diza qaaday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">duge hayqqida asati dizaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">duufon wodheththa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">yaan dhumason tani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">ta hiixa ongana.<verse eid="JOB 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14"/>Duufo, ‹Ta aawawu!›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">gaada ta xeygana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">tana miza guxuneta tani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">‹Ta aayee, ta michcheyee!›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">gaada xeygana.<verse eid="JOB 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15"/>Histtiin taas ay hidotay dizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:15">taas hidota gidiza miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:15">oonee taas xeellanay?<verse eid="JOB 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16"/>Tani duge si7oole wodhishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:16">hidotay tanara issife wodhanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:16">Issifekka duge duufon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:16">nu gelanee?»<verse eid="JOB 17:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Belidaade Haasaya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1"/>Shuha dere as Belidaadi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:1">hizgi zaarides;<verse eid="JOB 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2"/>Iyoobee! Ne ays</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:2">hayssa mala haasaya darsay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:2">Ane ezga; nunikka haasayoos.<verse eid="JOB 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3"/>Neni nuna ays meheta mala qooday;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:3">neni ays nuna tulleta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:3">akeekontta as ooththa xeellay?<verse eid="JOB 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4"/>Neni hanqettiko nena qohaasa attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">ne hanqozan biittay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">mela attenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">Zaallatikka ba dizasoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">qaaxxettenna.<verse eid="JOB 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5"/>Nagaranchcha xomppey to7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:5">tama lacoykka nam7anththo beettenna;<verse eid="JOB 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6"/>Iza dunkaane giddon diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:6">poo7oy to7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:6">poo7ozikka dhumana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:17">Iyo 21:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7"/>Izas mino tanggoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:7">qaammi qaammi baana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:7">gene qoppizaade qofay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:7">iza zaari kundisana.<verse eid="JOB 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8"/>Izi barkka biidi woximaden gelana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:8">iza tohoykka giten qaxettana.<verse eid="JOB 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9"/>Woximadey iza qirphe oykkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:9">heenkka waaxi ashshana.<verse eid="JOB 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10"/>Sa7a bolla yarde wodoroy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">micettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">iza ogenkka woximadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">giigettides.<verse eid="JOB 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11"/>«Yashshi iza giddoththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:11">guyera kaalli kaalli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:11">goodereththees.<verse eid="JOB 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12"/>Iza wolqqay koshan wurides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:12">boshaykka iza dhayssanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:12">giigettides.<verse eid="JOB 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13"/>Hargey iza asateththa gilqisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:13">hayqoykka mulera ekki baana.<verse eid="JOB 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14"/>Hirgay baynda ammanetti diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">keeththafe izi goodettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">as ubbaa haariza hayqoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">iza ekkana.<verse eid="JOB 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15"/>Iza keeththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">ay miishshika attenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">izi aqizasozankka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">diine tamay laalettana.<verse eid="JOB 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16"/>Xaphoppe meliza miththa malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:16">haggatikka meqerettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:16">miththa mala gidana.<verse eid="JOB 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17"/>Biitta bolla iza qoppiza asi deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:17">iza goobateththika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:17">biittafe dhayana.<verse eid="JOB 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18"/>Izi Poo7osoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:18">gede dhuman goodettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:18">biitta bollafe izi kichchana.<verse eid="JOB 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19"/>Iza dabbota giddofe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">iza laattana yeletay beettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">iza baachchanka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">zarey izas attenna.<verse eid="JOB 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20"/>Ushachcha baggaranne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">hadirsa baggara diza asay;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">iza bolla gakkida metoza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">keehi babbidi kokkorana.<verse eid="JOB 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21"/>Ay wodekka iita asata wurseththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">hessa mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">Xoossas yayyontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">asa qaaday hayssa.»<verse eid="JOB 18:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobe Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1"/>Iyoobi hizgi zaarides;<verse eid="JOB 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2"/>«Intte tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">awude gakkanaas waayisandetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">Awude gakkanaas yo7on</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">taas meqeth menththandetii?<verse eid="JOB 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3"/>Hekko intte tana tammuto cayeeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:3">tana kawushshishekka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:3">yeellatekketa.<verse eid="JOB 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4"/>Tumukka tani balettidaa gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:4">ta balay tana xalla qohana.<verse eid="JOB 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5"/>Tumu intte inttena dhoqqisidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:5">ta kawushshateththaa inttes</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:5">marshe miish ooththeeta.<verse eid="JOB 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6"/>Gidikkoka hayssa ubbaa metoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">ta bolla gaththidaynne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">gite giddo tana yeggiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">Xoossa gididayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">intte erana mala ta koyays.<verse eid="JOB 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7"/>Ta qohettadis gaada woossiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">tana siyiza as demmabeekke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">ta qaala dhoqqu ooththada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">magannikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">suure pirda demmabeekke.<verse eid="JOB 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8"/>Xoossi taas ogeza gordida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">aadhdhanaasoy deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">ta baanaasozakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">dhuman gordides.<verse eid="JOB 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9"/>Ta bonchchoza ta hu7eppe qaaridi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:9">tana kawushshides.<verse eid="JOB 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10"/>Ta asateththa Ubbasora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">qoxereththidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">mulera laallides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">taas diza hidota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">xaphoppe shodettidi kundiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">miththa mala ooththides.<verse eid="JOB 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11"/>Xoossi tana hanqettidi gita meto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:11">ta bolla gaththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:11">baas morkke mala tana qoodides.<verse eid="JOB 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12"/>Tana dhayssanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">ba oosanchchata kiittides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">taas dunkaaneza yuuyi aadhdhidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">tana giddoththida.<verse eid="JOB 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13"/>«Xoossi ta ishati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">taappe haakkana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">ooththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">tana eriza asati ubbay tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">asa dere as kessida.<verse eid="JOB 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14"/>Ta dabboti taappe haakkida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:14">ta laggetikka tana balida.<verse eid="JOB 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15"/>Tani tason imaththateth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">mokka ekkidayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">ubbay tana balida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">ta garadeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">tana imaththa mala qoodida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">allaga malakka xeellida.<verse eid="JOB 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16"/>Tani ta oosanchchaza xeygishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">izi taas koyenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">«tana maaddarkkii»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">ga ta waassishinkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">ero geenna.<verse eid="JOB 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17"/>Ta machcha taappe ke7iza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:17">peenoza shaatettadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:17">ta ishatikka hararettida.<verse eid="JOB 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18"/>Qeeri naytikka tana kadheettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:18">tana be7iza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:18">ta bolla qilcceettes.<verse eid="JOB 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19"/>Taas mata laggetikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:19">tana shaatettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:19">ta siiqoti ta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:19">morkke gidi dendida.<verse eid="JOB 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20"/>Taas ashozi wuriin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:20">galbazi meqeththara oykettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:20">tana shiishshiin attadis.<verse eid="JOB 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21"/>«Ta siiqotoo! Xoossa kushey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">tana shocida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">ane zay taas mishettite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">Taas qadhettite!<verse eid="JOB 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22"/>Xoossi tana gooddoyssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:22">intteka tana aazas gooddeetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:22">Hayssa gakkanaas intte tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:22">waayisidayssi gidennee?<verse eid="JOB 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23"/>Hayssa gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">ta haasayda qaala akeekizaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">maxaafan xaafiza asi dizaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">tana ay mala ufayssaneeshin!<verse eid="JOB 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24"/>Iskirtoninne irsaasen xaafettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">woykko shuchcha bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">woocetti uttidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">mernaas daana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">ooththidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">ay mala tana ufayssandeeshin!<verse eid="JOB 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25"/>Gido attiin tana ashshizayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">paxa de7iza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">wurseththa woden</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">tana wozzanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">biitta bolla izi eqqanayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">tani erays.<verse eid="JOB 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26"/>Taas galbazi meetetti wurikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:26">tani ta asateththafe shaakettada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:26">tani Xoossaa beyanayssa erays.<verse eid="JOB 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27"/>Hara as gidontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">izakka tani ta hu7en</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">ta ayfera beyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">ta wozinayakka he gallassayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">keehi laamotees.<verse eid="JOB 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28"/>«Ta siiqotoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">Tana walassidi waayisanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">‹Hayssa metoza izi barkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">baas ehides› gidi haasayeeta.<verse eid="JOB 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29"/>Xoossa hanqoy mashshan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">qaxxayeteththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">gaththiza gishshas mashshay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">inttena montta mala naagettite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">Xoossa pirday dizayssaka erite.»<verse eid="JOB 19:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Zoofaare Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1"/>Na7imaane dere as Zoofaarey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:1">hizgi zaarides;<verse eid="JOB 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2"/>«Iyoobee! Tana yiillo qofay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">ne bolla zaaro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">immana mala sugides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">hessa gishshassa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">ta haasayanawu eesotiday.<verse eid="JOB 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3"/>Tani tana kawushshiza seera siyays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">ta akeekiza akeekazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">tana nees</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">zaaro imma imma gees.<verse eid="JOB 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4"/>«Asi biitta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">beettoosofe doommidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">kaseppe hayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">gidoyssa ne eray?<verse eid="JOB 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5"/>Iita asa ceeqeteththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">guuththa wodessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">Xoossa kaddiza asatas diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">ufayssay qiphida ayfey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">xeellana gakkanaassa.<verse eid="JOB 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6"/>Iita asi aykkoka otorettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6">salo gakkikokka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6">iza hu7ey shaara gakki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6">bochchiinkka,<verse eid="JOB 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7"/>izi ba sheeshsha uteththa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:7">mulera pitettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:7">kase iza beyishe diza asatikka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:7">‹Izi awan dizee gaanee?›<verse eid="JOB 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8"/>Agumo mala tim7i gi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">dhayza gishshas beettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">omarsa elunththa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">izi dhayana.<verse eid="JOB 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9"/>Izi dizasoppe eeshora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">dhayza gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">issito iza be7ida as</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">nam7anththo zaari beyenna.<verse eid="JOB 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10"/>Iza nayti aadashidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">istta aaway manqotappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">genera bonqqida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">miishsha zaarana.<verse eid="JOB 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11"/>Wolqqan kumida yelagateththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:11">asateththay guuththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:11">wodeppe guye biitta gidana.<verse eid="JOB 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12"/>«Iitateththi iza doonan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:12">kaththa mala ay mal7ikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:12">ba inxarsan izi laacci xeellikokka,<verse eid="JOB 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13"/>wurontta mala doonan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:13">coommishe gam7ikokka,<verse eid="JOB 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14"/>Iza ulo giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">camon laamettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">izas shooshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">marze mala gidana.<verse eid="JOB 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15"/>Iita asi ba mida miishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">un7etti zaarana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">ulo giddon dizayssaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">Xoossi iza cooshshana.<verse eid="JOB 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16"/>Iita asi mizayssi wuri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">izas shooshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">marze mala gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">shooshsha marze mala gididi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">iza wodhana.<verse eid="JOB 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17"/>Wogara zaytey di7o mala goggishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">eessinne maaththi shaafa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">haaththa mala goggishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">izi be7ontta hayqqana.<verse eid="JOB 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18"/>Izi ba daaburda daabura ayfe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">zaareththi gede immana attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">ba hu7es meenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">Zal7idi izi shiishshida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">de7ozankka ufayettenna.<verse eid="JOB 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19"/>Hayssika hanzayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">izi manqota un7eththida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">gishshassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">ba ooththontta keeththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">genen ekkida gishshassa.<verse eid="JOB 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20"/>«Iza hirgeteththazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:20">izas shemppo dhayssides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:20">izi shiishshida haaroykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:20">iza ashshanawu dandayenna.<verse eid="JOB 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21"/>Iza haaroy wuri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">qucetti wuriza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">izas doonan gelththanaazikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">attenna.<verse eid="JOB 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22"/>Aykokka izi dure as gidiinkka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:22">iza yiilloy gakkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:22">daro metoykka izara gayttana.<verse eid="JOB 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23"/>Izi ta maada kallana gishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">Xoossi wolqqama hanqo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">iza bolla yeggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">ba hanqozakka iza bolla gussana.<verse eid="JOB 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24"/>Izi birata mashshafe attiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:24">xarqimala wondafen cadettana.<verse eid="JOB 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25"/>Wondafezikka zokkaara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">kanththi ke7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">xoxolqu giza xeerazi izas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">tireza duusereththidi aadhdhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">wolqqama hirgan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">iza wozinay dagammana.<verse eid="JOB 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26"/>Izi shiishshida haarozi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">ubbay girdi gida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">dhuma giddon dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">asi oyththontta tamay xuuggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">izason attiza miish ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">dippi histtana.<verse eid="JOB 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27"/>Izi ooththida nagara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">saloy qonccisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">sa7ayakka izas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">morkke gidada dendana.<verse eid="JOB 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28"/>Xoossas hanqo gallas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:28">iza soon diza haaroy wuri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:28">di7on qucetti dhayana.<verse eid="JOB 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29"/>Xoossi makkallanchchatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:29">woththida qaaday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:29">iita asati ekkana waagay hayssa.»<verse eid="JOB 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobe Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1"/>Iyoobikka hizgi zaarides;<verse eid="JOB 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2"/>«Ane ta haasaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">wozinappe ezgite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">hayssi intte tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">minththeththida mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">inttes qoodettana.<verse eid="JOB 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3"/>Issito haasayana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:3">taas gishi immite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:3">hessafe guye intte koyida mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:3">tana qidhanawu dandayeeta.<verse eid="JOB 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4"/>«Tani asho may7ida asa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:4">bolla mishettazinaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:4">Histtiin taas dandayontta aggiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:4">izan aazi malalisizee?<verse eid="JOB 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5"/>Ane taakko ha xeellite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:5">haasayay inttena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:5">xoonanaashe gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:5">ta hanozi inttena shaaphees.<verse eid="JOB 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6"/>Tani qoppishin tanakka daganththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:6">ta asateththaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:6">yashshan kokkorisees.<verse eid="JOB 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7"/>«Ays iita asata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">layththay aduqqidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">istta haaroykka daridi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">biitta bolla dizee?<verse eid="JOB 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8"/>Ays istta naytinne nayta nayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:8">diccidi lo7i dishin beyizoo?<verse eid="JOB 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9"/>Istti aykko hirgay baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">saron deettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">Xoossafe boshay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">istta bolla gakki erenna.<verse eid="JOB 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10"/>Istta mehetikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:10">issi metoy baynda yeletteettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:10">isttas miizatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:10">awucayontta yeleettes.<verse eid="JOB 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11"/>Bantta nayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:11">dorsa wude mala heemmeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:11">istta naytikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:11">guppi guppi kaa7eettes.<verse eid="JOB 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12"/>Karabe baqqishe, diiththi diixxishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:12">dinke punnishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:12">ufayssan yexxeettes.<verse eid="JOB 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13"/>Bantta layththa wogeteththaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:13">ufayssan aaththeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:13">waayettontta ha biittafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:13">hayqon shaaketteettes.<verse eid="JOB 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14"/>«Hessi hessaththo gidi dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">istti Xoossa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">‹Nuuppe haakka; ne oge eranaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">nu koyokkon› geettes.<verse eid="JOB 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15"/>‹Nu izas goynnana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">izi oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">Nu iza woossiin izi nuna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">ay maaddanee?› geettes.<verse eid="JOB 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16"/>Istti hessa gizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">istta kushen diza haaroy wuri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">istta wolqqan isttas shiiqida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">misatiza gishshassa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">Tani gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">iita asata qofa ekkike.<verse eid="JOB 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17"/>«Histtiin iita asatas xomppey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">to7i erizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Boshay istta bolla gakki erizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Xoossika istta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">hanqetti erizee?<verse eid="JOB 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18"/>Istti happa mala carkon bidasoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:18">gudulla mala gote carkon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:18">istti pitetti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:18">dhayda wodey dizee?<verse eid="JOB 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19"/>Intte, ‹Aawati qohida qohon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">Xoossi nayta hanqettees› geeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">ane Xoossi nagaranchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">qaxxayo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">hessaththo hankko bantta qoho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">istti akeekanawu dandayeettes.<verse eid="JOB 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20"/>Nagaranchchati bantti ooththida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">qohon bantta qixaate ekketto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">ubbaa dandayza Xoossi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">ba hanqoza istta bolla eho.<verse eid="JOB 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21"/>Asi hayqqidaappe guye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:21">ba naytas qoppi erizee?<verse eid="JOB 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22"/>«Xoossi gita asata bollaka pirdana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:22">histtiin asi iza pirda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:22">tamaarsana dandayzee?<verse eid="JOB 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23"/>Issi issi asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23">bantta layththa wurseththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23">gakkanaas aykko metoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23">istta bolla gakkontta minotanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23">hargey bayndayta gididi<verse eid="JOB 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24"/>istta bollay ordidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:24">kayshida mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:24">istta meqeththaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:24">shicida mala hayqqeettes.<verse eid="JOB 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25"/>Harati gidikko yiillonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">camon kumida mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">meton oykettida mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">aykko lo7o miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">be7ontta hayqqeettes.<verse eid="JOB 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26"/>Ubbayka duge duufon gelidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:26">biitta gideettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:26">guxuneykka istta laattana.<verse eid="JOB 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27"/>«Be7ite! Intte tana qohanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:27">qoppidi intte qachchida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:27">geneza ta erays.<verse eid="JOB 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28"/>Intte, ‹Hayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">gita addaasoy awanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">Nagaranchchaza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">duussasoy awanee?› geeta.<verse eid="JOB 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29"/>Mandara asata oychchibeekketii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29">Istti inttes markkattida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29">markkateththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29">intte ekkeketii?<verse eid="JOB 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30"/>Heyti, ‹Iita asata bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">boshay yiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">qohoy istta gakkenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">Xoossa hanqoy qoncciza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">istti atti baana› giidi haasayda.<verse eid="JOB 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31"/>Iita as iza iitateththaa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:31">walassizay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:31">Iza iita oosoza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:31">iza qaxxayanay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32"/>Izi hayqqidaappe guye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32">iza aha tookki ekkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32">duufon efeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32">iza duufoykka naageettes.<verse eid="JOB 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33"/>Shoobban diza biittay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">izas giiga gidees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">asati ubbayka iza kaalleettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">addafe daro asatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">izappe sinththara beettes.<verse eid="JOB 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34"/>«Histtiin intte hada gidida yo7ora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">tana minththeththanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">ays qoppeetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">Intte taas immiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">zaaroti ubbay wordo.»<verse eid="JOB 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Elfaaze Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1"/>Temaane dere as Elfaazey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:1">hizgi zaarides;<verse eid="JOB 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2"/>«Asi Xoossa go7anawu dandayzee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">Haray attoshin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">era as gidikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">go7azi izaadesafe attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">Xoossas gidenna.<verse eid="JOB 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3"/>Ne xilloteththi Ubbaa Dandayza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">Xoossaa ay go7anee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">Wosoy baynda ne de7ozi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">iza ay maaddanee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 35:6-8">Iyo 35:6-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4"/>Histtiin ne bolla izi pirdidaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:4">hayssaththo nena hanqiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:4">neni Xoos yayyiza gishshassee?<verse eid="JOB 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5"/>Hayssi ubbay nena gakkiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">ne iitateththi darida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">gishshassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">ne nagaray zaway bayndayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">gidida gishshas gidennee?<verse eid="JOB 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6"/>Issi gaasoykka baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">ne ishatappe oyso ekkadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">qasse istta may7o qaara ekkada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">istta kallo ashshadasa.<verse eid="JOB 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7"/>Gafidinne saamettidi daaburdayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:7">kaththinne haath diggadasa.<verse eid="JOB 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8"/>Ne gadaadenne wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">as gidada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">izan diza bonchcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">as gidikkoka,<verse eid="JOB 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9"/>Neni am7e maccassata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">mela kushe yeddadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">yi7o naytikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">bana ayssana de7oza dhayssadasa.<verse eid="JOB 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10"/>Hayssa gaason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">nena oykkana woximadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">nena yuuyi aadhdhides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">ne ezgontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">metoy nena daganththana.<verse eid="JOB 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11"/>Nena Xeeloy metana gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:11">nees dhumides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:11">di7o haaththika nena meeccides.<verse eid="JOB 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12"/>«Xoossay dhoqqa salon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">dizayssa gidennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">Xoolintteti aykkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">dhoqqasohon diikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">izi isttafe bollara diidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">istta xeellees.<verse eid="JOB 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13"/>Neni gidikko, ‹Xoossi ay erizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">Girdi gida dhuman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">izi waani nu bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">pirdanawu dandayzee?<verse eid="JOB 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14"/>Salo bollan izi simerettishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">dhippi gida shaaray</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">iza kammiza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">izi beyanawu dandayenna› gaasa.<verse eid="JOB 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15"/>«Nagaranchchati simerettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:15">beni ogeza ne kaallay?<verse eid="JOB 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16"/>Isttika wodey gakkontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">sinththara boshan shocettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">di7onkka meecettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">xaphora dhayda.<verse eid="JOB 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17"/>Isttika Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:17">‹Nuuppe ne haakka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:17">ne nuus ay ooththanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:17">dandayay?› gida.<verse eid="JOB 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18"/>Gidikkoka istta keeththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">dureteththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">kunththiday Xoossa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">Hessa gishshas tani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">iita asata qofa ekkike.<verse eid="JOB 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19"/>«Kiya asati iita asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">qaxxayettishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">be7idi ufayetteettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">suure asati istta bolla qilcceettes,<verse eid="JOB 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20"/>‹Tunkka nu morkketi dhayda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:20">istta haarozi kumeth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:20">taman xuugettides.›<verse eid="JOB 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21"/>«Hessa gishshas Iyoobe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">nenateththaa Xoossas haarisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">izarakka ne saron da;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">ne hayssa ooththiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">lo7o miish demmana.<verse eid="JOB 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22"/>Xoossi nees immiza timirtaa ekka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:22">iza qaalakka ne wozinan woththa.<verse eid="JOB 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23"/>Nenateththaa ne Ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">Dandayza Xoossaako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">ne zaaridaakko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">ne kase mala hanana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">ne sooppe iita ooso digga.<verse eid="JOB 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24"/>Worqqa gudullan ola;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:24">ofire worqqa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:24">shaafa shuchcha mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:24">wora ola.<verse eid="JOB 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25"/>He wode Ubbaa Dandayza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:25">Xoossay nees</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:25">worqqanne muuruta bira gidana.<verse eid="JOB 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26"/>He wode Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:26">neni ufayettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:26">izan ammanettada ne daana.<verse eid="JOB 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27"/>Ne izakko woossiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:27">izi ne woosaa siyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:27">ne adinettidayssa izas gaththana.<verse eid="JOB 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28"/>Ne qofay ubbay nees polettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:28">nees oge ubbay poo7o gidana.<verse eid="JOB 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29"/>Xoossi otoranchchata kawushshana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:29">ashketa gidikko izi ashshana.<verse eid="JOB 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30"/>Nenikka suure wozinay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">dizaade gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">Xoossi iita ubbaafe nena naagana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">ne kushetikka qoho oosoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">geesh gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">Xoossi nena ashshi ekkana.»<verse eid="JOB 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobe Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1"/>Iyoobikka hizgi zaarides;<verse eid="JOB 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2"/>«Ha7ikka ta wozinay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">camo qofaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">zuuzunththan kumides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">gencecan ta woossiinkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">iza kushey ta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">deexxida mala dees.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iza kushey ta bolla deexxida mala dees gizayssi Ibraaweta maxaafan ta kushe pude denththanaas tana deexxees gees.</char></note><verse eid="JOB 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3"/>Izi dizasota eridaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">ay mala dosazinaashin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">gede izi dizaso gakkidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">ta ay mala ufayettaneeshin;<verse eid="JOB 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4"/>ta maganaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">ta izas shiishshanakkoshin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">ta mishaza maarara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">ta izs shiishshanakkoshin.<verse eid="JOB 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5"/>Taas imettiza zaarozakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">ta eranakkoshin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">tana izi ay gaanaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">ta eranakkoshin.<verse eid="JOB 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6"/>Histtiin Xoossi ba gita wolqqara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:6">tana pirdandeshaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:6">Akkay; ta gizayssa izi ezgana.<verse eid="JOB 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7"/>Heenkka suure asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">izara marshettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">taas pirdiza Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">mernaas tana naxa kessana.<verse eid="JOB 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8"/>«Gido attiin ta arshey mokkiza bagga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">biikko heen izi deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">arshey wulliza baggaka simmiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">iza demmanawu dandaykke.<verse eid="JOB 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9"/>Izi gidikko pudehan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">ba oosaa ooththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">tani gidikko iza beyanawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">dandayabeekke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">duge bagga simmadakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">iza demmanawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">dandayabeekke.<verse eid="JOB 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10"/>Izi ta tanggo ubbaa erees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">tana izi paaccikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">tani worqqa mala geesh gida dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">izi tana demmana.<verse eid="JOB 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11"/>Ta tohoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">izi dosiza ogetara beettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">baleththon hadirsika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">ushachchika giikke.<verse eid="JOB 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12"/>Tani iza azazotappe ke7ikke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">iza qaalaakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">ta miza qumappeka aaththada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">ta wozinan naagadis.<verse eid="JOB 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13"/>«Izi barkka bana danday dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">izara eqettanay deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">izi ba dosidayssa ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">ooso dandayees.<verse eid="JOB 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14"/>Ta bolla izi qoppidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">ubbaa polana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">hayssa misatiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">daro qofati deettes.<verse eid="JOB 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15"/>Hessa gishshas iza sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:15">eqoy keehi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:15">tana keehi yashshees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:15">ta hayssa qoppada yayyadis.<verse eid="JOB 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16"/>Xoossi taas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">wozinay daaburana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">ooththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">tana daganththides.<verse eid="JOB 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17"/>Girdi gida dhumay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">ta ayfeta goozikkoka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">sakkanna dhumay ta haasayontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">tana diggibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 23:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1"/>«Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">ays ba pirda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">immana gallassa baribeennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">Izas ammanettidayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">awude gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">iza pirda qaala naagettandettoo?<verse eid="JOB 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2"/>Iita asati zawa laalleettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:2">kaysi ehida dorsata heemmeettes.<verse eid="JOB 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3"/>Yi7ota hare bonqqeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:3">am7e maccassaya boora oyththadus</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:3">giidi banttas ekkeettes.<verse eid="JOB 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4"/>Manqota shaatettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">coo ogeppe gooddeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">istta sinththafe baqatidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">qotettana mala ooththeettes.<verse eid="JOB 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5"/>Manqoti bazzon diza hardida mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">bantta naytas kath</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">koyana ke7idi daabureettes.<verse eid="JOB 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6"/>Unetidi haratas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">kath shiishshizayta gideettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">iita asata haaro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">gidida woyne tokkizasohozan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">geedon attida pushulo maxeettes.<verse eid="JOB 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7"/>Kumeththa omars</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">kallo ichchi aqeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">mooce ashshiza may7oy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">isttas deenna.<verse eid="JOB 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8"/>Zuma bolla bukkiza iran</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">istta asateththay musees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">aqizasoy dhayiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">zaalla gars shiiqi aqeettes.<verse eid="JOB 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9"/>Aaway hayqqida nay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">isttas aylle gidana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">aayey dhanth diggidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">bonqqeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">metotidayssa naaza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">ba aco gishshas giidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">oyso ekkeettes.<verse eid="JOB 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10"/>Manqoti aykko may7oy baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">paxa kallo ooson geleettes.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">Kaththa shiisho wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">mirqqeza tookki miiyishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">banttas gafan hayqqeettes.<verse eid="JOB 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11"/>Iita asata gaden wogara ayfeppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">zayte kesseettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">woyne miththa ayfeppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">cajje ageettesseshin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">istti gidikko saametteettes.<verse eid="JOB 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12"/>Katamatan hayqqanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">tooqiza asati gootareettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">madunxida asatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">maado oyshon waasseettes.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">Xoossi gidikko istta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">oosettida geneza beyibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13"/>Poo7o ixxiza asati deettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">poo7oy aazakko erontta gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">poo7o oge kaallettenna.<verse eid="JOB 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14"/>Shempo wodhiza uray</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">wonttontta dendidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">manqotanne metotanchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">wodhees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">omarsika kaysos kezees.<verse eid="JOB 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15"/>Layma uray</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">gadey omarsanayssa naagettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">oonikka be7ontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">ba sinththa goozeettes.<verse eid="JOB 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16"/>Kaysoti kaysotanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">omarsara keeth bookki geleettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">gallas gidikko qotetti pe7eettes.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">Poo7oka ixxeettes.<verse eid="JOB 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17"/>Dhumara shiroteththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">istta ufayssiza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">ubbaasikka girdi gida dhumay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">isttas wontta maalado mala.<verse eid="JOB 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18"/>«Gidikkoka istti haaththa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">beettiza hoomo mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">guuththa wodes xalla istti beettana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">Istta biittayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">qanggettidayssa gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">istti woyne miththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">tokkizasohoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">oonikka beenna.<verse eid="JOB 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19"/>Shachchi ho7on maayidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">dhayzayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">si7ooleykka nagaranchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">baakko bonqqa ekkana.<verse eid="JOB 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20"/>Istta aayeti ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">istta dogana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">istta ashozakka guxuney maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">iita asati qofettokona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">hessaththoka miththa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">meqerettana.<verse eid="JOB 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21"/>Hayssi ubbay istta bolla gakkiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">istti yelontta maynida maccassata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">bonqqida gishshassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">istta azinati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">hayqqida maccassatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">aykko qadheteththika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">bessontta gishshassa.<verse eid="JOB 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22"/>Gido attiin Xoossi ba wolqqan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">daannateththan diza asata diggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">isttas de7oy giiga misatikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">istta duussas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">ammanththiza miishshi deenna.<verse eid="JOB 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23"/>Xoossi istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">saron daana mala ooththikokka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">istti biza oge ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">tishshi histti xeellees<verse eid="JOB 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24"/>Iita asati guuththa wodes duretana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">gido attiin eesora sharafa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">shulli dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">shulla kaththa mala buucettana.<verse eid="JOB 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25"/>«Hayssa mala gidenna geetettiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">tani wordanchchatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">ta haasayda qaalay likke gidonttayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">oonee ammanththanay?»<verse eid="JOB 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Belidaade Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1"/>Shuha dere as Belidaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:1">hizgi zaarides;<verse eid="JOB 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2"/>«Maataynne yashshateththi Xoossassa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:2">bollan ba haarizason salon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:2">saroteth medhdhana.<verse eid="JOB 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3"/>Iza wottadarata tiripateththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">qoodettanawu dandayzee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">Xoossa poo7oy izas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">poo7isonttaadey oonee?<verse eid="JOB 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4"/>Asi Xoossa sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">waani xillo gidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">beettanawu dandayzee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">Asho may7ida medheta gididi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">waani geesh gidanawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">dandayzee?<verse eid="JOB 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5"/>Hekko Xoossa sinththan aginaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:5">muqqa booth gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:5">xoolinttetikka iza sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:5">geeshshata gidettenna.<verse eid="JOB 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6"/>Musanne guxune gidada hayqqiza asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:6">hessafekka ay mala iita!»<verse eid="JOB 25:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobe Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1"/>Iyoobi hizgi zaarides;<verse eid="JOB 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2"/>«Hayssa ne haasayoyssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">daaburanchchata maaddida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">nees misatizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">Qesey argacidaade minththida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">nees misatizee?<verse eid="JOB 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3"/>Aadho erateththi paccidaades</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">ne ay zore immadii!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">Ay erateththika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">izaades qonccisadi!<verse eid="JOB 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4"/>Histtiin hayssa ne haasayana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">nena maaddiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">Ne haasayana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">nena denththeththiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">oona ayanaa!»<verse eid="JOB 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5"/>«Wolqqama wogga gita abbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:5">garsan diza hayqqidayta shemppoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:5">wolqqama kokkorsan deettes.<verse eid="JOB 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6"/>Si7ooleykka Xoossa sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">qonccen dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">Abadoone geetettizasoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">ay miishshika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">kammanawu dandayenna.<verse eid="JOB 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7"/>Xoossi pudeha baggara diza saloza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:7">carko bolla miccides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:7">biittaaka aykkoy bayndason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:7">kuulloti daana mala ooththides.<verse eid="JOB 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8"/>Xoossi shaarati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:8">haath xunxi oykkana mala ooththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:8">haaththafe dendoyssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:8">shaarati daaketettenna.<verse eid="JOB 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9"/>Izi uttiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:9">kawoteththa araata genththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:9">shaararakka kammana.<verse eid="JOB 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10"/>Poo7onne dhuma shaakkanaas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:10">wolqqama wogga gita abbaa sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:10">saloza zawa ooththidi miccides.<verse eid="JOB 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11"/>Izi hanqiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:11">salo tuussati dagaman kokkoreettes.<verse eid="JOB 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12"/>Izi ba wolqqan abbaa co7u ooththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:12">iza aadho erateththayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:12">Era7aabe geetettizayssa dhayssana.<verse eid="JOB 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13"/>Ba peenozan saloza geeshshana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:13">xongettiza shooshshaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:13">ba kushen caddana.<verse eid="JOB 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14"/>Haytanti ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">Xoossi ooththiza oosotappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">guuththata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">nu siyizayssi izas saasuketh xalla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">wolqqama giirissa izayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">ooni akeekanawu dandayzee?»<verse eid="JOB 26:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobe Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1"/>Iyoobikka ba haasaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:1">sinththawu gujjidi hizgides;<verse eid="JOB 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2"/>«Suure pirda diggidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">ta shemppoyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">addafe camo ooththida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">Ubbaa Dandayza De7o Xoossa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">sunththan caaqqays;<verse eid="JOB 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3"/>Xoossi tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:3">shemppora woththida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:3">wodey gakkanaas,<verse eid="JOB 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4"/>ubbaaka iita qaalay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:4">ta doonappe ke7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:4">ta inxarsankka wordo haasaykke.<verse eid="JOB 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5"/>Intte haasaydayssi wuri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">likke gaada mulekka ekkike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">ta hayqqanaashe gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">suureteththan minna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">eqqanayssa aggike.<verse eid="JOB 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6"/>Tani ta xilloteththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">minna eqqana attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">xilloteththa aggike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">shemppora paxa diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">layththa ubbaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">ta wozinay ha miishshan sidhenna.<verse eid="JOB 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7"/>«Nagaranchchata bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">pirdettiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">ta morkketa bolla pirdetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">tana ixxizayta bollaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">gene asata bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">pirdettiza mala pirdetto.<verse eid="JOB 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8"/>Xoossi istta shemppoyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">istta ashoppe shaakkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">istta layththa qanxxida wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">Xoossa kaddida asatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">ay hidotay daandee?<verse eid="JOB 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9"/>Metoy istta bolla yiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:9">Xoossi istta waasoza siyandee?<verse eid="JOB 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10"/>Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">istti ufayettandettoo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">Woden wodenkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">Xoossa sunththa xeygandettoo?<verse eid="JOB 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11"/>«Xoossa wolqqay ay mala gitakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">ta inttena tamaarsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">qoppi woththoyssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">ta inttefe qottike.<verse eid="JOB 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12"/>Inttenikka hayssa ubbaa ereeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:12">histtiin hayssa hada miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:12">ays haasayeetii?<verse eid="JOB 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13"/>«Hekko Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">iita asinne genanchchati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">ekkana laatay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">hayssafe kaallizayssa.<verse eid="JOB 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14"/>Iza nayti tiripikkoka olan wurana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:14">iza zereththatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:14">kaththi dhayiin koshattana.<verse eid="JOB 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15"/>Hessafe attidayti hargen wurana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:15">am7etikka isttas yeekkettenna.<verse eid="JOB 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16"/>Iita asi bira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">biitta mala shiishshanawu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">may7oka mana biitta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">dooranawu dandayees.<verse eid="JOB 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17"/>Gido attiin iita asi shiishshida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">may7oza xillo asi may7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">izi shiishshida biraakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">geeshshati gishetti ekkana.<verse eid="JOB 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18"/>Izi keexxiza keeththatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:18">achcharo keeththa malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:18">kath naagizaadey aqiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:18">gaabba mala laalettana.<verse eid="JOB 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19"/>Iita asi wurseththa wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">dure gididi ichchees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">izi beeggiza wode gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">iza aqotay ubbay dhaydes.<verse eid="JOB 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20"/>Dagamay iza bolla di7o mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:20">qoppontta dishin gakkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:20">giddoththika gote carkoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:20">iza denththi efana.<verse eid="JOB 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21"/>Arshey mokkizaso bagga carkoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:21">izasoppe iza pitti dhayssana.<verse eid="JOB 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22"/>Izi baqatidi atti baanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">baaxetikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">carkozi qadheteththi baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">iza bolla gede minnana.<verse eid="JOB 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23"/>Carkozi iza bolla kushe baqqides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:23">izi dizasoppe wayqeththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:23">pixiri yeggides.<verse eid="JOB 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Aadho Erateth Nashshanaas Shiiqida Ginxo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1"/>«Tumappe biitta garsan diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:1">ma7idineti bookettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:1">bira ke7izasoynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:1">worqqay seeri oosettizasoy dees.<verse eid="JOB 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2"/>Biratay biittafe beettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:2">xarqimalay ma7idine shuchchafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:2">seeridi ke7ees.<verse eid="JOB 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3"/>Asay dhuma kanththidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">duge biitta giddo bookki gelidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">haakki dizasoza duge wodhdhidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">girdi gida dhuma giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">ma7idine shuchcha koyeettes.<verse eid="JOB 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4"/>Asi dizasoppe haakkidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">asa tohoy yedhdhi eronttaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">gakkeettes.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">Heenkka ciimma olla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">bookkeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">wodoro bollara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">kuulloti kuulloti wodhidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">asappe shaaketti barkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">ooththeettes.<verse eid="JOB 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5"/>Biittay meetettiza kath immees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:5">Izas giddoy taman seeridi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:5">shiretti shiretti wodhdhees.<verse eid="JOB 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6"/>Semppere geetettiza al7o shuchchay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">biittan diza shuchchata giddon beettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">he biitta giddonkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">worqqay beettees.<verse eid="JOB 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7"/>Gede ma7idinezakko efiza oge</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:7">xilloyka erenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:7">ankkota ayfeykka beyibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8"/>Iita do7ati he sohoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">yedhdhibeettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">gaammoyka iza baggara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">aadhdhibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9"/>Asi gade goyishe mino shuchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">ba kushen denththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">zumatakka xaphoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">shiri yeggees.<verse eid="JOB 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10"/>Zaallaka phalqidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">iza giddora aadhdhanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">oge kessees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">al7o gidida ma7idine</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">shuchchatakka demmees.<verse eid="JOB 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11"/>Shaafata pulttota teqqees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:11">biitta giddon qotan diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:11">miishshata qoncce kessees.<verse eid="JOB 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12"/>Histtiin aadho erateththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:12">awappe beettizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:12">Akeekasikka dizasoy awaa?<verse eid="JOB 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13"/>Aadho erateththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">shemppora paxa diza medhetati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">diza biittan beettuku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">izis tuma waagakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">eriza asi deenna.<verse eid="JOB 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14"/>‹Wogga gita abbayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:14">ta giddon duukku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:14">abbayka tanara duukku› gees.<verse eid="JOB 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15"/>Erateththi geeshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">worqqan shamettuku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">izi waagaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">biran heregettenna.<verse eid="JOB 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16"/>Aadho erateththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">ofire geetettiza worqqafe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">margidenne semppere geetettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">al7o shuchchatappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">aadhdha bonchchettidaaro.<verse eid="JOB 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17"/>Worqqaynne geeshsha heregay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">izira ginattettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">xintta worqqafe oosettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">geexeykka izo laammana.<verse eid="JOB 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18"/>Bonchchettida heleloynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">almaaze geetettizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">aadho erateththara ginattettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">aadho erateththa gatey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">luule geetettizayssafekka bolla.<verse eid="JOB 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19"/>Tophaaziyoone geetettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">Tophphiya biitta inqquyka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">izira ginenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">keehi geeyida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">worqqafekka aadhdhawus.<verse eid="JOB 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20"/>«Histtiko erateththi awappe yazee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:20">Akeekaykka awappe beettazee?<verse eid="JOB 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21"/>Shemppora paxa diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">medhetatappe geemmidaaro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">salora piradhdhiza kafotikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">koyidi izo demmettenna.<verse eid="JOB 28:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22"/>Dhayoynne hayqoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:22">‹Nu izi gishshas erizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:22">woren xalla› geettes.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wore gizayssa issi issi bagga gamoththo qaalan paapunththa geetes.</char></note><verse eid="JOB 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23"/>Aadho erateththako efiza ogezanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:23">iza dizasoza erizay Xoossa xalla.<verse eid="JOB 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24"/>Izikka sa7a gaxa kumeth demmees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:24">saloppe garsan dizayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:24">ubbaa beyees.<verse eid="JOB 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25"/>Izi carko wolqqa ooththida wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:25">wogga gita abba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:25">izi makkida wode,<verse eid="JOB 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26"/>irassinne wolqqanththara diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:26">dadas woga woththida wode,<verse eid="JOB 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27"/>Xoossi erateth be7ides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:27">paacci xeellidi izo bonchchides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:27">pilggi be7idi minththi woththides.<verse eid="JOB 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28"/>He wode asas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">‹Hekko erateth guussi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">Xoossas yashshateththa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">akeeka guussi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">iitappe haako› gides.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 111:10">Maza 111:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:7">Isa 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:10">9:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 28:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobi Wurseththan Shiishshida Magana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1"/>Iyoobikka ba haasaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:1">sinth gujjidi hizgides;<verse eid="JOB 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2"/>«Taas ha7i de7ozi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">kase Xoossi tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">naagiza wodeza mala gididaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">tana ay mala ufayssandeeshaa!<verse eid="JOB 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3"/>He wode dhuma giddora ta bishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:3">Xoossi taas poo7isishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:3">tani poo7on hemettaysikoshin.<verse eid="JOB 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4"/>Xoossa maadoy ta keeththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">kase naateteththa wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">naagizayssaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">ha7ikka naagidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">aazee dizay?<verse eid="JOB 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5"/>Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">tanara diza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">ta nayti ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">ta yuushon deetteskoshin.<verse eid="JOB 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6"/>Tani toho maaththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">meecettanaashe gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">daro maath demmayskoshin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">wogara miththati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">mela biittankka tokettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">di7o mala goggiza daro zayte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">taas immeetteskoshin.<verse eid="JOB 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7"/>Katama penge achchan diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:7">dubbusha baada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:7">duulatan ta uttiza wode,<verse eid="JOB 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8"/>naateththa nayti tana be7idi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:8">bonchchos ta sinththafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:8">issi bagga geettesishin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:8">cimatikka ta bonchcho gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:8">ba uttidasohoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:8">dendi eqqeettesishin.<verse eid="JOB 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9"/>Haasayshe diza dere kaaleththizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:9">tana be7idi bantta kushetan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:9">ba doona doona oykkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:9">co7u geetteskoshin.<verse eid="JOB 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10"/>Dere daannatikka tani dizason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">co7u geettesishin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">isttas inxarsi oykettiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">haasayaykka istta xooneeskoshin.<verse eid="JOB 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11"/>Tana siyida ubbay nashshides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:11">tana be7ida ubbay galatides.<verse eid="JOB 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12"/>Hayssika haniday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">tani manqota woosa siyada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">istta ashshizayssanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">yi7o nayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">ta maaddiza gishshassa.<verse eid="JOB 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13"/>Hayqqana matida asata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">ta maaddiza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">tana istti anjjida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">am7e maccassata ta maaddiza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">ufayssan yexxida.<verse eid="JOB 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14"/>Xilloteth may7o mala may7adis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">suure pirdaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">kaabba mala gopha may7adis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">qoobe malakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">hu7en woththadis.<verse eid="JOB 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15"/>Qooqetas ayfe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:15">wobbetaskka toho gidadiskoshin.<verse eid="JOB 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16"/>Manqotas aawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:16">ta erontta asataskka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:16">apakatokoshin.<verse eid="JOB 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17"/>Gene asa banqila menththadis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:17">izi bonqqi ekkidayssaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:17">iza doonappe yegisadis.<verse eid="JOB 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18"/>«Tani, ‹Ta layththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">ancco mala dariin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">tani tason diza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">bonchchon hayqqana›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">gadiskoshin.<verse eid="JOB 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19"/>Xaphoti ubba wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">haaththe demmiza malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">haggatikka xaazan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">cililiza miththa malakkoshin.<verse eid="JOB 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20"/>Ubba wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">ta bonchchettida mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">dayskoshin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">ta wolqqayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">ubba wode ooraxeskoshin.<verse eid="JOB 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21"/>Asay ta zoreza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:21">laamotan co7u giidi ezgees.<verse eid="JOB 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22"/>Ta haasayay istta aliza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:22">taappe guyera haasayza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:22">asi deenna.<verse eid="JOB 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23"/>Goshshanchchay badhdhesa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">ira demmanawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">amottizayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">isttika ta haasaya siyanawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">bantta doona doydi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">naageetteskoshin.<verse eid="JOB 29:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24"/>Ta miicca bessishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">istti ufayettetes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">ta sinththay poo7ishin xirphotida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">istta sinththay birshettees.<verse eid="JOB 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25"/>Kase ta istti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">koyida mala ayssayskoshin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">ba ola asa kaaleththiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">kawo mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">ta istta kaaleththadiskoshin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">istti muuzottishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">tani istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">minththeththayssikoshin.<verse eid="JOB 29:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1"/>«Istta aawati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">taas dorsa wudeza heemmiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">ta kanatara montta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">istti ta kadhiza asatakkoshin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">ha7i gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">layththan taappe naatiza asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">ta bolla qilcceettes.<verse eid="JOB 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2"/>Isttas wolqqay ixxida gishshassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:2">istta bollay gilqida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:2">aykkoka tana go7ettenna.<verse eid="JOB 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3"/>Metoppenne kosha daroppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">dendidayssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">bazzo biitta bi biidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">miththa xapho maxeththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">gancceettes.<verse eid="JOB 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4"/>Maxine mala mal7iza bazzon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">mokkiza dumma dumma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">miththa hayththata maxeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">mal7ontta sankkara xapho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">qorereththi meettes.<verse eid="JOB 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5"/>Asi kaysota waassidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:5">gooddizayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:5">isttika deraa giddofe gooddeettes.<verse eid="JOB 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6"/>Istti bantta duussaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">haaththi baynda shaafa giddon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">asi baynda bazzo biittaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">kelka giddon bookettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">gongolotan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">dosay baynda de7ida.<verse eid="JOB 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7"/>Woray dizaso yuuyi yuuyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:7">wora do7ata mala waasseettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:7">wora garsan issi bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:7">shiiqetti aqeettes.<verse eid="JOB 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8"/>Bantta biittafe xurqafen shocetti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:8">goodettida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:8">lo7o sunththinne wozinay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:8">bayndayta gididi deettes.<verse eid="JOB 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9"/>Ha7i qasse istta nayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">yeththan tana qidheettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">tani istta giddonkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">miiceteththas attadis.<verse eid="JOB 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10"/>Tana shaatettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:10">taappe haakkeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:10">aykko yeellayka baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:10">ta sinththan cutetteettes.<verse eid="JOB 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11"/>Xoossay ta wolqqa daabursidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">tana kawushshida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">istti qasse bixalay baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">para mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">ta bolla dhoodhu dhoodheettes.<verse eid="JOB 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12"/>Taappe ushachcha baggara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">yeda diccidayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">ta bolla dendida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">tana oykkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">woximade woththida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">tana giddoththida.<verse eid="JOB 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13"/>Taas aadhdhizaso dhayssidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">tana wodhana koyeettes.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">Istti hayssaththo ooththanayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">digganaadey deenna.<verse eid="JOB 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14"/>Di7oy menththi gelizayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">isttika tana cuggi gelida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">ubbaaka menththereththidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">ta bolla yida.<verse eid="JOB 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15"/>Gita dagamay tana gakkides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">taas diza bonchchoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">carko mala aadhdhides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">ta attana giza hidotay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">shaara mala dendi dhaydes.<verse eid="JOB 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16"/>«Ta shemppoya keeha ceecadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:16">hayqoska matadus.<verse eid="JOB 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17"/>Omars kumeth ta meqeththati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:17">hargen waayetteettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:17">sakozikka taas shemppo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:17">immenna.<verse eid="JOB 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18"/>Tana sakkiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">wolqqama sakoza gaason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">ta may7oy gundi moorettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">qoodhe xunththa shamize mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">tana cuulli oykkides.<verse eid="JOB 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19"/>Xoossi tana duge</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">biittan olida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">tani gudullanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">bidinth misatadis.<verse eid="JOB 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20"/>Xoossoo, ta nena woossadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">gido attiin ne taas zaarabeekka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">ta eqqada neekko woossadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">neni gidikko ne sinththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">taakko zaarabeekka.<verse eid="JOB 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21"/>Ne taas addafe menxe iitadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:21">neni ne gita wolqqankka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:21">tana gooddadasa.<verse eid="JOB 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22"/>Ne tana denththada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">carko bolla woththadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">izi tana yuushshana malakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">ooththadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">gote carkoyka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">tana shirechchi shirechchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">yeggees.<verse eid="JOB 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23"/>Asa ubbaas qaada gidida hayqos</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:23">ne tana aaththada immanayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:23">ta erays.<verse eid="JOB 30:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24"/>«Issi metotida uray</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">maado demmanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">ba kushe miccidi woossishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">tumappe ay asikka iza qohenna.<verse eid="JOB 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25"/>Tani metotida asatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:25">yeekkabeekkinaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:25">Manqotaska mishettabeekkinaa?<verse eid="JOB 30:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26"/>Lo7o miish demmana ga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">ta naagishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">iita miishshi tana gakkides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">poo7oy yaana ga ta naagettishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">taas gallassay dhumides.<verse eid="JOB 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27"/>Ta wozinay daro ceecides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:27">ay saroka demmabeekke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:27">meto gallassatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:27">ta bolla gakkida.<verse eid="JOB 30:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28"/>Ta bollay awa xuussan gidontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">muuzoteththan karexxides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">duulata asa sinththan eqqada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">maado taas oychchays.<verse eid="JOB 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29"/>Asappe shaakettada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:29">worakanatas isha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:29">guttotas lagge gidadis.<verse eid="JOB 30:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30"/>Taas galbazi karexxidi dendides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:30">taas bollazikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:30">mishan xuugettides.<verse eid="JOB 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31"/>Tani ta ufays</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">isttan qonccisiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">bagananne zayey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">ha7i ta kayottada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">kessiza zilassa qaala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">sissiza miish gidida.<verse eid="JOB 30:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobi Ba Wurseththa Haasaya Polides</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1"/>«Lo7o maccassako xeellada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:1">amottontta mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:1">tani ta ayfetara caaqo geladis.<verse eid="JOB 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2"/>Bollan de7iza Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">asas ay qaada immandeesha?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">Salon diza Ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">Dandayza Xoossafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">asas imettida gishay aazeeshaa?<verse eid="JOB 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3"/>Iita asa bolla qohoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:3">nagaranchcha asa bollaka dhayoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:3">gakkanayssi erettidaaz gidennee?<verse eid="JOB 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4"/>Xoossay ta ooththizayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:4">ubbaa beyennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:4">Ta hemetakka shaakki erennee?<verse eid="JOB 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5"/>Tani wordo haasaydaa gidikko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:5">asakka baleththidaa gidikko;<verse eid="JOB 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6"/>Xoossi tana suure</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:6">geeddaran geeddaro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:6">Tani xillo gididayssa shaakki ero.<verse eid="JOB 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7"/>Ta suure ogeppe ke7idaa gidikko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">Ta ayfey be7ida ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">ta wozinay amottidaa gidikko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">qasseka ta kushey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">nagaran tunidaa gidikko,<verse eid="JOB 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8"/>tani zeridayssa hara asi mo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:8">Ta caarechchazikka kumeththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:8">shodetti oletto.<verse eid="JOB 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9"/>«Ta wozinay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">hara macca amottidaa gidikko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">ta shooroza machcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">laymatanaas iza pengen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">ta zuggidaa gidikko,<verse eid="JOB 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10"/>ta machcha hara asas gaaccu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:10">qasseka hara addey izira zin7o.<verse eid="JOB 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11"/>Hayssika keehi tuna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:11">Wogankka qaxxayssiza nagara.<verse eid="JOB 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12"/>Ha nagaray tama mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">xuuggiza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">ta hayssa ooththidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">ta aqota xuuggi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">dhayssanakkoshin.<verse eid="JOB 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13"/>«Maccanne attuma gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">ta aylleti tana mootiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">istta mootoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">ta kadhada aggidaa gidikko,<verse eid="JOB 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14"/>Xoossi tana pirdiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">tani waananee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">Qasse izi tana oychchiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">tani ay zaaro immanee?<verse eid="JOB 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15"/>Ta aayey ulon tana medhdhidayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">ta aylletakka medhdhiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">iza gidennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">Nuna ubbatakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">aayi ulon medhdhiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">iza deennee?<verse eid="JOB 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16"/>«Manqoti tana woossiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">ta digga erikke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">Qasseka am7e maccassata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">minththeththontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">agga erikke.<verse eid="JOB 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17"/>Yi7onne yitto nayta aggada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:17">ta kath tarkka mabeekke.<verse eid="JOB 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18"/>Tani ta yelagateththafe doommada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">tani istta aawa mala dichchadis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">ta de7o layth ubbaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">am7e maccassata maaddadis.<verse eid="JOB 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19"/>May7oy dhayiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:19">meegoy wodhizaade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:19">woykko metoppe dendidayssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:19">kallo dizaade beyada,<verse eid="JOB 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20"/>ta dorsata iskefe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">oosettida may7o ta mayziin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">izaade ho7iin tana zaari galatontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">aggida wodey deenna.<verse eid="JOB 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21"/>Tani mooton istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">laththanayssa erada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">aaway baynda nayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">naaqqidaa gidikko,<verse eid="JOB 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22"/>ta kushey hasheppe ke7o.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:22">Ta qeseykka kurezappe koldo.<verse eid="JOB 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23"/>Tani Xoossa hanqos</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">yayyiza gishshassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">iza teemateththaas yayyiza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">Hayssa mala yo7ota ooththanawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">ta dandaykke.<verse eid="JOB 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24"/>«Tani taas diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">aqotan ammanettabeekke.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">Woykko payya worqqaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">taas ammanettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">miish ooththabeekke.<verse eid="JOB 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25"/>‹Taas diza aqoy darides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">Tani dureteththafe dendidayssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">daro miish demmadis› gaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">ufayetta erikke.<verse eid="JOB 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26"/>Arshe poo7oza beyada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:26">agina lo7eteththa beyada,<verse eid="JOB 31:26"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27"/>ta wozinan istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">geemara bonchchabeeke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">qasseka ta kushe micca yeerada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">isttas goynnabeekke.<verse eid="JOB 31:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28"/>Tani hayssa mala ooththidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">salon diza xoossa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">kaddo gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">hayti ha oosoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">ta bolla pirda ehiza nagarata.<verse eid="JOB 31:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29"/>«Ta morkketa kundeththaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">tani ufayettabeekke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">iita miishshi istta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">gakkishinkka miiccabeekke.<verse eid="JOB 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30"/>‹Ta morkketi dhayetto› ga qanggada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:30">nagara ooththabeekke.<verse eid="JOB 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31"/>Tani ubba wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">imaththa mokkizayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">taso aylleti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">ta gishshas markkatteettes.<verse eid="JOB 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32"/>Tani ta keeththa kare</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">ogera aadhdhi biza mandaras</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">doya woththadis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">Hessa gishshas gadey qammiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">yida imaththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">karen ayssa erikke.<verse eid="JOB 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33"/>Tani ta mooro genththabeekke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:33">hara asata mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:33">ta nagaraakka qottabeekke.<verse eid="JOB 31:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34"/>Tana asa daroy yashissininne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">soo asata kadhoy daganththiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">tani tason co7u gaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">qotettida wodey deenna.<verse eid="JOB 31:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35"/>«Ta gizayssa siyizaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">beettereneshin!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">Tanikka teqe qaala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">shiishshanakkoshin!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">ta gizayssa zaaro izi immo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">Tana mootiza mootanchchay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">tana mootizayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">xaafi shiishshiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">ta beyarkinaashin!<verse eid="JOB 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36"/>Woyto mala tani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">ta hashen tookkanakkoshin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">kallachcha malakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">ta hu7e bolla goxxana.<verse eid="JOB 31:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37"/>Daannateththi diza asa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">Xoossa sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">yayyontta eqqada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">ta ooththida ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">qonccisa yootanakkoshin.<verse eid="JOB 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38"/>«Asa gade wogay baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:38">bonqqa ekkada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:38">tani goyidaa gidikko,<verse eid="JOB 31:38"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39"/>he gadaa godata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:39">ta mishisidaa gidikko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:39">aykkoka isttas immontta dashe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:39">mokkida kaththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:39">tani midaa gidikko,<verse eid="JOB 31:39"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40"/>he ta goyiza goshshason diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">gistte gishshas agunththi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">bangga gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">sharafay mokko» gides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">Iyoobi ba haasaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">hayssan polides.<verse eid="JOB 31:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Eelihu Haasaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOB 32:1-37:24">32:1—37:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1"/>Iyoobi, «Tani xillo asa» giza qofa laammontta gishshas heedzdzu asati iza zorizayssa aggida. <verse eid="JOB 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2"/>Eraama zereththafe Buuze dere as Barakele naa Eelihuy; Iyoobi bana Xoossafe aaththidi xillisida gishshas Iyoobe bolla keehi hanqettides. <verse eid="JOB 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3"/>Qasseka Iyoobe lagge heedzdzati Iyoobe bolla pirdafe attiin iza ammanththiza qaala yooti ammanththontta gishshas istta bollaka hanqettides. <verse eid="JOB 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4"/>Eelihuy hankkoytappe yelaga gidida gishshas hankkoyti banttas dizayssa haasayi wursanaashe gakkanaas Iyoobera haasayanawu ba tara naago bolla dees. <verse eid="JOB 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5"/>Iyoobe lagge heedzdzati Iyoobes bessiza zaaro immanaas dandayontayssa be7idi keehi hanqettides.<verse eid="JOB 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6"/>Buuze dere as Barakele naa Eelihuy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">«Tani inttefe yelaga gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">gishshassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">intte cima gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">pokkoynne yashshi tana oykkiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">hanno gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">ta qofa qonccisontta gam7adis.<verse eid="JOB 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7"/>‹Cimati sinththati haasayetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:7">bantta layththan demmida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:7">aadho erateththafe tamaarsetto›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:7">ga qoppadis.<verse eid="JOB 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8"/>Gido attiin asa giddon aqidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:8">aadho erateth asas immizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:8">Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossa ayana.<verse eid="JOB 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9"/>As aadho eranchcha kessizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">cimateth gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">qasseka asi akeekanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">dandayzay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">izaades layththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">aduqqida gishshas gidenna.<verse eid="JOB 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10"/>«Hessa gishshas lo7eththi siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:10">tanikka ta qofa inttes yootana.<verse eid="JOB 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11"/>Intte haasayza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">tani co7u gaada ezgays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">intte haasayana qaala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">qoppishinka tani naagays.<verse eid="JOB 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12"/>Tani intte haasayzayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">lo7eththa siyadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">gido attiin inttefe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">oonikka Iyoobi mooranchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">gididayssa ammanththidaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">qasseka iza haasayas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">bessiza zaaro immiday deenna.<verse eid="JOB 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13"/>Iyoobe haasayas bessiza zaaro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">immanaas dandayzay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">Xoossafe attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">as gidontta gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">intte, ‹Nuni aadho erateth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">demmidos› giidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">coo hada ceeqettofte.<verse eid="JOB 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14"/>Iyoobi marshettiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">inttenarappe attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">tanara gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">tanikka intte haasayzayssa malan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">izas zaaro immike.<verse eid="JOB 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15"/>«Istti dagammidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">haasayza qaalay dhayda gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">aykko haasayanawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">dandaybeettenna.<verse eid="JOB 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16"/>Hekko! Istti haasayza miishshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">dhayiin co7u giidi eqqida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">histtiin tanikka co7u ga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">naaganaas taas bessizee?<verse eid="JOB 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17"/>Akkay! Co7u giikke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:17">tanikka ta baggara diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:17">zaaroza immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:17">ta qofaakka qonccisana.<verse eid="JOB 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18"/>Ta haasayanaas bessizaazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:18">daroy diza gishshas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:18">tanan diza ayanay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:18">tana wolqqara haasayssees.<verse eid="JOB 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19"/>Be7ite! Tani haasayontta aggiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">woyne cajje woththiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">ooraththa lukkamoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">shempizaso dhaydi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">dhuuqqanaas puurizayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">ta giddoy puuridi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">dhuuqqana gakkides.<verse eid="JOB 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20"/>Ane! Tani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:20">hayssafe haasayada shempays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:20">ta doona doyada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:20">tani haasayanaas bessees.<verse eid="JOB 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21"/>Hayssa ha yo7ozan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:21">tani oonakka maaddike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:21">woykko ay asakka aadashikke.<verse eid="JOB 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22"/>Tani as aadashoy mulekka hanenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:22">ta hessa mala ooththiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:22">tana medhdhidayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:22">tana hanqana.<verse eid="JOB 32:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1"/>«Iyoobee! Ta nees</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:1">yootizayssa siya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:1">ta nees gizayssaka akeekan ezga;<verse eid="JOB 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2"/>ta nees zaaro immanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:2">giigetta uttadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:2">ta doonaykka haasayanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:2">giigetti uttides.<verse eid="JOB 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3"/>Ta haasayza qaalati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">ta wozina suureteththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">qoncciseettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">ta inxarsay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">ta eriza tuma haasayees.<verse eid="JOB 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4"/>Tana medhdhiday Xoossa Ayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:4">taas de7o immiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:4">Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossa Ayana.<verse eid="JOB 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5"/>Neni dandayzaa gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">ta goyssas zaaro imma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">ne gaanayssa giigsada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">tanara haasayeeta.<verse eid="JOB 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6"/>Hekko! Tani Xoossa sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:6">nenara gina;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:6">tanikka medhettiday urqqafe.<verse eid="JOB 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7"/>Neni taas yayyanaas bessenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:7">tanikka nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:7">naaqqanawu koshshenna.<verse eid="JOB 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8"/>Neni haasayda ubbaa ezgashe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:8">ta gam7adis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:8">ne inxarsafe ke7ida qaalata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:8">ta siyadis.<verse eid="JOB 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9"/>Neni haasayashe, ‹Tani qohoynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">borey baynda asa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">tani nagara ooththonttaadenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">xillo asa.<verse eid="JOB 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10"/>Gido attiin Xoossi tana qaxxayanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:10">gaaso koyees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:10">tanakka baas morkke mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:10">qoodees.<verse eid="JOB 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11"/>Ta tohota izi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">duruman duxxi qachchides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">Ta bizaso ubbaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">tana xeellees› gadasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:27">Iyo 13:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12"/>«Iyoobee! Hayssi ne haasayay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">bala gidides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">tanikka nees</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">qonccisanaas koyays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">Xoossi asa ubbaafe aadhdhees.<verse eid="JOB 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13"/>Histtiin, ‹Neni Xoossi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">asi maganiza magana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">siyenna› gaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">ays Xoossa bolla zuuzumay?<verse eid="JOB 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14"/>Asi akeekennafe attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:14">Xoossi dumma dumma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:14">ogera haasayees.<verse eid="JOB 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15"/>Omars asi hiixan ichchi diza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">asi koyro dhisko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">seeraagida wode;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">agumoninne ajjuutankka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">Xoossi haasayees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:13">Iyo 4:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16"/>He wode asi iza qaala siyana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">hayththa doyees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">izi ba immiza seerankka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">daganththees.<verse eid="JOB 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17"/>Hessa mala ooson asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:17">nagara ooththontta mala diggees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:17">otoreteththaaka isttafe denththees.<verse eid="JOB 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18"/>Xoossi asa shemppo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:18">dhayoppe ashshees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:18">bashsha hayqoppeka wozzees.<verse eid="JOB 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19"/>Woykko asi meqeththan gelida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">sakon dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">asi ba balappe simmana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">harge hiixan Xoossi zorees.<verse eid="JOB 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20"/>Hayssa malan harganchcha kath</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:20">lanqanaas iza iitees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:20">lo7o kaththika harassees.<verse eid="JOB 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21"/>Gilqateththappe dendoyssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:21">izas ashozikka wurides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:21">meqeththi xalla attides.<verse eid="JOB 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22"/>Iza shemppoy kezanaassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:22">moogettanaas matides.<verse eid="JOB 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23"/>«Asi suure oge bessanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">shiyan qoodettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">Xoossa kiitanchchatappe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">issoy iza maaddanaas yidaakko,<verse eid="JOB 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24"/>kiitanchchay izas qadhettidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">‹Iza wozzizaade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">ta demmida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">izi duge duufon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">wodhdhontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">aggaaga!› giidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">hayqo oykkidaakko,<verse eid="JOB 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25"/>hessa gishshas iza asateththay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:25">qeeri naa asho mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:25">zaari ooraxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:25">izas yelagateththa wode mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:25">qasseka hanana.<verse eid="JOB 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26"/>He wode Xoossako izi woossana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">Iza woosaakka Xoossi siyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">Xoossa sinth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">izi be7idi ufayettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">Xoossika iza woosaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">zaaro immana.<verse eid="JOB 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27"/>Izi asa sinththan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">‹Tani nagara ooththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">suure gididayssaka geellasadis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">Xoossay gidikko ta moora mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">taas ooththibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28"/>Tani duufon gelontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:28">tana ashshides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:28">hekko ha7i paxa daada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:28">tani poo7o beyays› gi yexxides.<verse eid="JOB 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29"/>«Hekko! Xoossi hayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:29">ubbaa miishsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:29">asas zaari zaari ooththees.<verse eid="JOB 33:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30"/>De7on diidi poo7o beyana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:30">iza shemppo hayqoppe ashshees.<verse eid="JOB 33:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31"/>«Iyoobee! Ta nees yootizayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:31">lo7eththa siya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:31">tani nees yootays</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:31">ane neni co7u ga.<verse eid="JOB 33:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32"/>Neni haasayanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">koyza miishshi diikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">taas yoota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">ta neni xillo gididayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">nena bessana koyays.<verse eid="JOB 33:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33"/>Akkay giikko!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">Tani haasayzayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">co7u gaada siya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">tani nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">erateth tamaarsana» gides.<verse eid="JOB 33:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1"/>Eelihuy ba haasaya gujjidi hizgides;<verse eid="JOB 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2"/>«Intteno aadho eranchchatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">Ta inttes haasayzayssa siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">intteno eranchchatoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">ta haasaya ezgite.<verse eid="JOB 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3"/>Inxarsi kaththa mal7o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">shaakki erees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">hessaththoka hayththi yo7o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">shaakki erees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:11">Iyo 12:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4"/>Tumu gidida yo7o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">ane shaakki eroos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">lo7o gidida miishshika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">issife tamaaroos.<verse eid="JOB 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5"/>«Iyoobi, ‹Tani xillo shin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:5">Xoossi tana suure pirda diggides.<verse eid="JOB 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6"/>Tani tumanchchashin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">wordanchcha mala qoodettadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">ta aykkoka moorontta dashe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">paxontta madunththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">waayettays› gides.<verse eid="JOB 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7"/>Iyoobe mala Xoossa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:7">qilccizaadey beettandeesha?<verse eid="JOB 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8"/>Izi iita ooththizaytara laggetees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:8">izas peyshayka iita laggetara.<verse eid="JOB 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9"/>‹Xoossa ufayssana giidi oosoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:9">as aykkoka maaddenna› gees.<verse eid="JOB 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10"/>«Akeekiza asatoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">ane tana ezgite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">Iita oosoy Xoossafe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">bala oosoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">Ubbaa Dandayza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">Xoossafe haakko!<verse eid="JOB 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11"/>Xoossi asas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">izaade ooso mala immees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">izas izaade hemeththa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">ooththees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Maza 62:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12"/>Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">mulekka iita miish ooththenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">ay asaska</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">suure pirda geellasenna.<verse eid="JOB 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13"/>Xoossasi biitta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">hadara immidaadey deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">iza alame bollaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">shuumidaadey deenna.<verse eid="JOB 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14"/>Xoossi ba ayanazanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:14">ba shemppoza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:14">baakko zaari ekkana koyidaakko,<verse eid="JOB 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15"/>asho may7iday kumeth dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:15">asa zereththika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:15">duge biittan simmana.<verse eid="JOB 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16"/>Neni akeekizaa gidikko hayssa siya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:16">ta nees haasayzayssa ezga.<verse eid="JOB 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17"/>Suure pirda ixxizaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">dere ayssanaas dandayzee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">Neni xillonne wolqqama Xoossa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">nagaranchcha kessay?<verse eid="JOB 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18"/>Kawota intte dhalleketa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:18">shuumetakka intte iita</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:18">gaanay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19"/>Ubbatikka iza medhetata gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">gishshas izi shuumeta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">shaakki maaddenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">duretakka manqotappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">shaakkenna.<verse eid="JOB 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20"/>Istti leela giddoth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">qoppontta hayqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">ubbay kokkori dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">wolqqamatikka oona kusheykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">bochchontta kichchana.<verse eid="JOB 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21"/>«Xoossi asa ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:21">tanggoza xeellees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:21">issaa issaa hemeth kaalleettes.<verse eid="JOB 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22"/>Iita asati qotettana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:22">girdi gida dhumay deenna.<verse eid="JOB 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23"/>Xoossi asa bolla pirdanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:23">bare immenna.<verse eid="JOB 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24"/>Wolqqama daannata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">daannateththafe denththanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">isttasohon hara woththanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">aykko oyshay shiiqontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">izi hessaththo ooththees.<verse eid="JOB 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25"/>Izi istta oosaa eriza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:25">issi omars</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:25">istta daannateththafe dhayssana.<verse eid="JOB 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26"/>Istti ooththida makkallateththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:26">gaason ubbaa asa sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:26">makkallanchchata qaxxayees.<verse eid="JOB 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27"/>Izi istta qaxxayizayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">istti iza kaallizayssa aggida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">gishshassa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">iza azazotakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">istti kadhida gishshassa.<verse eid="JOB 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28"/>Istti manqota un7eththida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">pude Xoossako waassana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">ooththida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">Xoossika manqota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">waasoza siyides.<verse eid="JOB 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29"/>Xoossi co7u giikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">oonee iza bolla pirdanay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">Izi ba zokko zaarikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">oonee iza beyanay?<verse eid="JOB 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30"/>Hessaththoka Xoossas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">yayyontta deraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">un7eththiza kawoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">deraa bolla dendiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">iza oonee digganay?<verse eid="JOB 34:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31"/>«Iyoobee! Neni ne nagara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">Xoossas paaxada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">zaara nagara ooththike ga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">qaala geladii?<verse eid="JOB 34:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32"/>Ta ooththida nagaray awayssako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">tana tamaarsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">ta mooridaa gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">zaarada izaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">ooththike! gadii?<verse eid="JOB 34:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33"/>Histtiin neni maarettanaappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">ixxis gaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">neni shiishshiza qofa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">Xoossi ne amoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">nees polana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">ne koyay?<verse eid="JOB 34:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34"/>«Tana siyiza asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:34">akeekiza eranchchatikka,<verse eid="JOB 34:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35"/>‹Iyoobi erateththi baynda haasayees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:35">hu7ey baynda haasayata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:35">haasayees› geettes.<verse eid="JOB 34:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36"/>Iita asata zaaro mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">zaariza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">Iyoobi wurseththi gakkanawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">paacettidaakko aazee dizay!<verse eid="JOB 34:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37"/>Nu giddon wogappe kare ke7ides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">Xoossa bolla kadhe darssides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">ba nagara bollaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">makkallateth gujjides» geettes.<verse eid="JOB 34:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1"/>Eelihuy ba haasaya gujjidi hizgides;<verse eid="JOB 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2"/>«Iyoobe ne nena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:2">‹Tani Xoossa sinththan Xillo›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:2">gizayssi likkee?<verse eid="JOB 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3"/>‹Nagara ooththontta aggiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">ta ay go7ettanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">qasseka ay demmanee?› gaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">neni oychchadasa.<verse eid="JOB 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4"/>Tani neessinne nenara dizaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:4">zaaro immana.<verse eid="JOB 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5"/>«Dhoqqu gaada pude salo xeella;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:5">neeppe dhoqqu giidi diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:5">shaara akeeka.<verse eid="JOB 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6"/>Neni nagara ooththiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:6">Xoossa aazan qohay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:6">Neni iza darsa darsa qohikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:6">iza ay ooththanawu dandayay?<verse eid="JOB 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7"/>Neni xillo gidikko izas ay immanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:7">Izi neeppe aykkoka koyenna.<verse eid="JOB 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8"/>Ne nagara ooththiko qohanay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:8">ne mala asata xalla.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:8">Ne lo7o miish ooththikoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:8">ne go7izay as xalla.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:2-3">Iyo 22:2-3</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9"/>«Asi haray darssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">qohishin waassees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">baappe wolqqatizaade kusheppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">bana ashshi ekkanaades</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">magannees.<verse eid="JOB 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10"/>Gido attiin isttafe oonikka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">‹Tana medhdhida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">Xoossay awanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">Leela giddoth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">mazamure immizayssi awanee?<verse eid="JOB 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11"/>Mehetappe nuna aaththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">tamaarsida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">salo kafotappeka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">aadho eranchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">ooththiday iza› giday baawa.<verse eid="JOB 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12"/>Istti waasseettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">izi gidikko istti otoranchchatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">iitata gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">isttas zaaro immenna.<verse eid="JOB 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13"/>Xoossi tuma wozinappe gidontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">waaso siyenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">hessa mala ezgenna.<verse eid="JOB 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14"/>Iyoobee! Neni ta Xoossa aykkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">be7ikke giikkoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">ne metoy iza sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">de7iza gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">neni dandayan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">naagana koshshees.<verse eid="JOB 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15"/>Qasseka Xoossi nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">ba hanqon hanqontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">asa iitateththa co7u giidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">aadhdhana nees misatizee?<verse eid="JOB 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16"/>Iyoobee! Neni coo mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">haasaya darsaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">erateththi baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">coo gaada haasayaasa.»<verse eid="JOB 35:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1"/>Eelihuy ba haasaya gujjidi hizgides;<verse eid="JOB 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2"/>«Xoossa gishshas tani haasayana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:2">haray diza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:2">guuth dandayada ta gizayssa siya.<verse eid="JOB 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3"/>Tani darosoppe demmida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">erateththan, tana medhdhida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">Xoossi Xillo gididayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">tani nees erisays.<verse eid="JOB 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4"/>Ta qaalay wordo gidonttayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">neni lo7eththa era;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">nenara haasayana taas kumeththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">erateththi dizayssa era.<verse eid="JOB 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5"/>«Tumukka Xoossi wolqqama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">gido attiin oonakka kadhenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">izi ubbaaka akeekees.<verse eid="JOB 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6"/>Izi iita asata paxa woththenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:6">Metotida asatas gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:6">suure pirda pirdees.<verse eid="JOB 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7"/>Xoossi xillo asata naagees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">kawota mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">bonchcho algan utisees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">mernaas istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">dhoqqu dhoqqu histtees.<verse eid="JOB 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8"/>Gido attiin asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:8">sansalatan qashettiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:8">woykko meto giten oykettiko,<verse eid="JOB 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9"/>istti ba otoreteththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:9">ooththida nagara qonccisees.<verse eid="JOB 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10"/>Istti seera siyana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">istta hayththaa doyees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">istti bantta iita oosaappe simmidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">maarettana mala azazees.<verse eid="JOB 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11"/>Istti Xoossas azazettidi ooththiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">banttas attida layththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">dureteththaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">ufayssan ongana.<verse eid="JOB 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12"/>Gido attiin iza siyontta ixxiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">istti olan wurana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">istti bantta eeyateththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">dishe hayqqana.<verse eid="JOB 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13"/>«Bantta wozinara Xoossa kaddizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">qaxxayettida mala daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">izi istta qaxxayshinkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">istta kaaleththizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">woossettenna.<verse eid="JOB 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14"/>Istti ba poliza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">iita laymateththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">boshan dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">bantta yelagateththa layththankka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">mulqqetti hayqqana.<verse eid="JOB 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15"/>Xoossi meton un7ettizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:15">istta metaappe ashshana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:15">istta gakkida metaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:15">isttas timirte immana.<verse eid="JOB 36:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16"/>«Hayssa ha wodezan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">Xoossi nees qoppizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">nena ne diza metaappe kessidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">lo7o kaththi kumida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">maaddan efanaassa.<verse eid="JOB 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17"/>Ha7i gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">ne ooththida mooraappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">dendoyssan ne bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">pirdettida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">nees bessiza qixaate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">eko bolla daasa.<verse eid="JOB 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18"/>Oonikka nena dureteththa daron</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">cimontta mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">matta7enkka nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">baleththontta mala naagetta.<verse eid="JOB 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19"/>Nees diza aqotaynne godateththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">daro gidikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">nena metoppe ashshettenna.<verse eid="JOB 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20"/>Deraa dizasoppe dhayssiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:20">dhuma wodey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:20">yaana mala amottofa.<verse eid="JOB 36:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21"/>Neni meto giddon paacettizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:21">hessa gaason gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:21">simmada nagara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:21">ooththontta mala naagetta.<verse eid="JOB 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22"/>«Xoossa wolqqay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:22">ay mala gitakko akeeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:22">Xoossi ubbaafe aadho astamaare.<verse eid="JOB 36:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23"/>‹Hayssa ooththa› giidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:23">Xoossa azaziza asi woykko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:23">‹Iita ooso ooththadasa› giidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:23">iza walassizay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24"/>Izi ooththiza oosaa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">asay ubba wode mazamuren</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">galatizayssa mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">nenikka iza oosaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">yeththan galata.<verse eid="JOB 36:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25"/>Asa zereththi ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">Xoossa oosaa be7ides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">asay tishshi ooththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">haakon be7ides.<verse eid="JOB 36:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26"/>Xoossa gitateththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">pilggidi gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">nuni dandayokko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">iza layththa qoodaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">nu erappe bolla.<verse eid="JOB 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27"/>«Xoossi haaththa abbafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">pude salo efees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">zaaridikka ira saloppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">duge bukisees.<verse eid="JOB 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28"/>Ira shaarappe kessidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:28">wolqqama ira asas bukisees.<verse eid="JOB 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29"/>Gido attiin Xoossi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">shaara wostti miccizaakko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">wolqqanththa giddon uttidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">izi waani haasayzaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">ooni eranawu dandayzee?<verse eid="JOB 36:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30"/>Xoossi abba ciimmateththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:30">kammidi izi ba yuushon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:30">wolqqanththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:30">wostti laallizaakko xeella.<verse eid="JOB 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31"/>Hayssa mala ooththidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:31">Xoossi ba deraa ayssees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:31">asay miza daro kaththaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:31">mokisees.<verse eid="JOB 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32"/>Wolqqanththa izi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:32">ba kushen oykkees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:32">oykkidi ba dosida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:32">bagga baana mala azazees.<verse eid="JOB 36:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33"/>Daday wolqqama iray</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:33">yaanayssa malatees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:33">mehetikka ira uushoy yizayssa ereettes.<verse eid="JOB 36:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1"/>«Wolqqama uushoppe dendoyssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:1">ta wozinay kokkorides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:1">Yashshateththafe dendoyssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:1">piri baana gakkides.<verse eid="JOB 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2"/>Iza doonappe ke7iza qaala siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:2">Dada mala guummiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:2">giirissa qaala siyite.<verse eid="JOB 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3"/>Saloppe garsan wolqqanththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:3">wolqqamees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:3">biitta gaxa gakkanawu kiittees.<verse eid="JOB 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4"/>Hessafe guye wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">ba giirissa sissees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">yashissiza ba giirissa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">dada mala guunththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">Wolqqanththa poo7oykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">zaari zaari beettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">ba yashissiza giirissan guummees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">Izi ba giirissa sissiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">wolqqanththa diggenna.<verse eid="JOB 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5"/>Xoossa giirissa gunththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">malalisiza gita guunth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">guummees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">nuni eranawu dandayontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">gita miishshata ooththees.<verse eid="JOB 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6"/>Biitta bolla shachchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:6">wodhdhana mala ooththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:6">wolqqama iraykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:6">bukkana mala azazees.<verse eid="JOB 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7"/>Izi medhdhida asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:7">iza ooso erana mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:7">ubbaa asay bantta oosoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:7">ooththontta mala teqqees.<verse eid="JOB 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8"/>He wode wora do7ati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">baqatidi bantta qoteteththaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">geleettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">bantta gongolozan qoteteettes.<verse eid="JOB 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9"/>Wolqqama carkoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:9">pudehappe dendees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:9">moociza carkoy pudehappe yees.<verse eid="JOB 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10"/>Xoossa peenoy haaththa moocisees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:10">izappe shach medhdhees.<verse eid="JOB 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11"/>Shaaray haaththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:11">tookkana mala ooththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:11">ba giddon wolqqanththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:11">wolqqamana mala ooththees.<verse eid="JOB 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12"/>Goda kaaleththon shaarati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">biitta yuushon yuuyeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">banttana maaddiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">azazotakka poleettes.<verse eid="JOB 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13"/>Xoossi ira bukisizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">biittaa irxxisanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">asata qaxxayanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">woykko ba siiqo qonccisanaassa.<verse eid="JOB 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14"/>Iyoobee! Neni takki gaada siya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">Xoossi ooththiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">malalisiza oosota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">wozinan woththada akeeka.<verse eid="JOB 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15"/>Xoossi shaara wostti azazizaakko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">wolqqanththaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">wostti wolqqanththizaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">neni eray?<verse eid="JOB 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16"/>Shaara salo bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:16">wostti woththidaakko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:16">malalisiza ubbaa eriza Xoossa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:16">oosoza ne eray?<verse eid="JOB 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17"/>Saloy xarqimala misatiza wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:17">wolqqama bazzo carkoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:17">biitta bolla carkiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:17">neni homben seerana.<verse eid="JOB 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18"/>Xoossi salo seerida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">mastoote mala micciko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">neni iza matan uttada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">maaddanawu dandayay?<verse eid="JOB 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19"/>«Nuus eray pace gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">nuni ay giidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">Xoossas zaaranaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">neni nuna ane tamaarsa.<verse eid="JOB 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20"/>Xoossara haasayana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">gaada oychchike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">ta iza oychchada aazas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">izi tana dhayssana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">denththeththoo?<verse eid="JOB 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21"/>Carkoy shaara saloppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">qucci geeshshiza wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">oonikka xolqiza arshe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">tishshi histti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">xeellanaas dandayenna.<verse eid="JOB 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22"/>Pudehappe worqqa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">xolqiza poo7oy yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">Xoossi malalisiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">teeman qonccana.<verse eid="JOB 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23"/>Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">nu qofappe bolla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">iza wolqqay gita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">izikka tumu pirdizaade.<verse eid="JOB 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24"/>Bantta qofan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">‹Nuni aadho eranchchata› gizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">izi kadhees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">hessa gishshas asay wuri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">izas yayyees.»<verse eid="JOB 37:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossafe Iyoobes Imettida Zaaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1"/>Hayssafe guye GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:1">gote carko giddon gididi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:1">Iyoobes hizgides,<verse eid="JOB 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2"/>«Hayssi eray baynda haasayan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:2">ta zoreza kadhizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:2">izi baas oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3"/>Ane adde gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">danccetta ta sinththan eqqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">tani nena oychchizayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">taas zaara.<verse eid="JOB 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4"/>Tani hayssa alameza medhdhishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">neni awan day?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">Ne erizanne akeekizaa gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">ane taas yoota.<verse eid="JOB 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5"/>Hayssi sa7ay ay keena gidanaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">qofa qachchiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">Sa7a bolla izi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">mixe wodorota micciday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">oonakko ne eray?<verse eid="JOB 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6"/>Biitta tuussati kundontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:6">minththi oykkida wolqqay aazee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:6">Alameza ooso doommishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:6">yochcha shuch yeggiday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7"/>Bakkale xoolintteti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">issi bolla yexxizaashe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">kiitanchchati ubbay ililizaashe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">neni awan day?<verse eid="JOB 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8"/>«Abbay biittafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:8">dhuuqqi ke7iza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:8">pultto ayfeta gordiday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9"/>Abba shaaran kammiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:9">Qasseka girdi gida dhuman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:9">gordiday tana.<verse eid="JOB 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10"/>Abbas zawa medhdhiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:10">pengenne zawa woththiday tana.<verse eid="JOB 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11"/>Hayssa gakkanawu ya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">Hayssafe aadhdhofa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">Ne wolqqama dambalay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">‹Hayssan eqqo› gadis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:8-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:22">Er 5:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12"/>«Iyoobee! Neni yelettoosofe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">wonttay wonttana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">azaza eray?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">Wontta poo7oska</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">soho giigsa eray?<verse eid="JOB 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13"/>Wonttay biitta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">poo7o bessana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">iita asati qotettidasoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">qoncce kezana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">ne istta azaza eray?<verse eid="JOB 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14"/>Wontta poo7oy biitta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">qalam7etti diza may7o mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">beettana mala ooththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">mana miishsha bolla diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">maatame mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">qonccen bessees.<verse eid="JOB 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15"/>Iitati poo7o digettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:15">istti makkallateththan denththida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:15">kusheykka meqqides.<verse eid="JOB 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16"/>«Ne duge ciimma abban</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:16">wodhdhadii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:16">Wogga gita abba garsan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:16">simeretta eray?<verse eid="JOB 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17"/>Hayqo pengeta nena bessidee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:17">Girdi gida dhuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:17">pengetakka beyadii?<verse eid="JOB 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18"/>Sa7ay ay keena dalga gididaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:18">ne eray?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:18">Ane hayssa ubbaa erizaa gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:18">ne taas yoota.<verse eid="JOB 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19"/>«Poo7oy dizaso efiza ogey awanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:19">Qasseka dhumay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:19">de7izasoy awakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:19">ne eray?<verse eid="JOB 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20"/>Neni poo7onne dhuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">istti dizaso dizaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">efanaas dandayayii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">Isttasoy dizaso efiza ogeza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">ne eray?<verse eid="JOB 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21"/>Neni biittay medhettiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">yelettida gishshassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">nees layththayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">daro gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">ne erontta aggaka!<verse eid="JOB 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22"/>Shachchi wodhdhiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">keeththan geladiyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">Woykko uttida shachcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">doore beyadii?<verse eid="JOB 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23"/>Hayssa ha shachchaza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">ta ola gallassasinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">meto gallassas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">go7ettanaas minjja woththidaaza.<verse eid="JOB 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24"/>Wolqqanththi awappe dendizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:24">Woykko arshey mokkiza baggafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:24">carkoy biitta bolla laalettizaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:24">efiza ogey awanee?<verse eid="JOB 38:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25"/>Iraththo wodhdhizaso giigsiday;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:25">daday walakettida uushos</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:25">oge giigsiday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26"/>Oonikka baynda biittan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:26">asikka dontta bazzon ashshizay,<verse eid="JOB 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27"/>iray bukkana malakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">ooththizay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">Asi baynda sohozanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">bazzo biitta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">haath kalssiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">biittayka maata mokkana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">ooththiday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28"/>Iranne xaaza immizay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29"/>Shachchinne kenchcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:29">immizay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30"/>Kenchcho haaththa shuchcha mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">minththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">abba haaththika shachchaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">shuchchatana mala ooththees.<verse eid="JOB 38:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31"/>«Piliyaadise geetettiza xoolintteta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">issi bolla qachchanaas dandayay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">Ooriyo geetettiza xoolintteti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">issi bolla oykettida wodoroza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">duuththanawu dandayay?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:9">Iyo 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:8">Amo 5:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 38:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32"/>Xoolintteta ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">istta woden woden</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">kessanawu dandayay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">Zardo geetettiza do7a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">medhoy diza xoolinte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">istta maaratara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">ne kaaleththanawu dandayay?<verse eid="JOB 38:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33"/>Saloti ay mala wogan a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">qizaakko eray?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">Hayssa ha wogazakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">biitta bolla oosisana dandayay?<verse eid="JOB 38:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34"/>«Daro ira nees bukisana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:34">shaara ne azazanawu dandayay?<verse eid="JOB 38:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35"/>Wolqqanth ne azazon wolqqamizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:35">Wolqqanth ne yeddanaas dandayay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:35">Isttika nees,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:35">‹Hekko nu haan doos› gi erizoo?<verse eid="JOB 38:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36"/>Wozinas cinccateth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:36">qoppanaas kaha immiday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37"/>Ba eran shaarata qoodanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37">dandayzay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37">saloppe haath duge tiganaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37">dandayzay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38"/>Gudulla oyseththidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:38">phashe kessanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:38">dandayzay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39"/>«Macca gaammoy wora giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39">zamada uttidaashin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39">ne izis miza miish shankkatada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39">immanaas dandayay?<verse eid="JOB 38:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40"/>Woykko gafi uttida izi marata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:40">kalssanawu dandayay?<verse eid="JOB 38:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41"/>Quuroti gafidi bichchariza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">istta ciyetikka miza miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">dhaydi taakko waassiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">isttas miza miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">immizay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1"/>«Genessati yeliza wode ne eray?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:1">Wusha geetettiza do7ay miixattidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:1">yelishin beya eray?<verse eid="JOB 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2"/>Istti seebbatidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:2">ay lagge wode gam7izaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:2">awude yelizaakko ne eray?<verse eid="JOB 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3"/>Gulbati miixattishe bantta marata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:3">istti yelizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:3">awudekko ne eray?<verse eid="JOB 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4"/>Istta marati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">woran diccidi minneettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">isttafe shaakettidi beettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">bidaappe guye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">bantta aayetakko simmettenna.<verse eid="JOB 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5"/>Hardiday yeda daana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:5">ooththiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:5">Istta qashoppe birshiday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6"/>Bazzoza isttas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">dizaso histta immadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">maxiney diza demban</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">istta woththadis.<verse eid="JOB 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7"/>Kachchi dariza katamatappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">haakkidi deettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">guyera laaggizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">qoodizayssa dosettenna.<verse eid="JOB 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8"/>Zumata bollan pe7eettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:8">heen baas gidiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:8">cilila maata koyeettes.<verse eid="JOB 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9"/>«Menththi nees ooththanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">eeno gaandee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">Woykko ne zedhen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">eeno gi eqqandee?<verse eid="JOB 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10"/>Menth waaxada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:10">gosh goyanawu dandayay?<verse eid="JOB 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11"/>Iza minoteththan ne ammanettay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:11">Nees deexxiza oosoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:11">izi ooththana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:11">izas agga eray?<verse eid="JOB 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12"/>Izi neekko simmi yaana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:12">ne kath bukkiza baley dizaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:12">miiyanayssa ammanettay?<verse eid="JOB 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13"/>«Yanchchay ba qefe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">eeson miccawus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">gido attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">sangano kafo mala piradhdhuku.<verse eid="JOB 39:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14"/>Yanchchay ba phuuphphulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:14">biittan yeggawus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:14">biitta giddon uttidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:14">ho7ana mala ooththawus.<verse eid="JOB 39:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15"/>‹Heera aadhdhizaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">ba tohon menththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">wora do7atikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">yedhdhi liiqiseettes›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">gaada qoppuku.<verse eid="JOB 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16"/>Ba ciyetas allaga mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">menxe iitawus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">izi daaburay hadan attikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">wuda guukku.<verse eid="JOB 39:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17"/>Hayssaththo izis cinccateth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:17">dhayssada iza erontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:17">ooththiday tana.<verse eid="JOB 39:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18"/>Iza dendada woxxiza wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:18">banara gaade woxxiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:18">togata bolla miiccawus.<verse eid="JOB 39:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19"/>«Iyoobee! Paratas wolqqa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:19">immidaynne adussa gamma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:19">istta morgen mayziday nenee?<verse eid="JOB 39:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20"/>Parata boole mala guppizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">istti harbuqishe asata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">daganththana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">ooththizay nenee?<verse eid="JOB 39:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21"/>Parati ola demba togetti bishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:21">bantta wolqqankka ceeqettishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:21">loddan adaraaso doommeettes.<verse eid="JOB 39:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22"/>Yash giza miish mulekka erettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">ay miishshika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">istta daganththenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">istta bolla giththa mashsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">denththidaakkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">guye simmettenna.<verse eid="JOB 39:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23"/>Istta toggiza olanchchati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">oykkida ola miishshati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">wawaci gishe bantta giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">giirettishe siyetteettes.<verse eid="JOB 39:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24"/>Zayey zayetishin co7u gi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:24">eqqanawu dandayettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:24">yiilloninne hanqon kumidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:24">ola demba woxxeettes.<verse eid="JOB 39:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25"/>Zayey punettida taybon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">ufayssan wayqeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">haakon dishe ola peeno ereettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">Ola kaaleththizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">immiza azazozanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">olanchchata ceeqeteththa siyeettes.<verse eid="JOB 39:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26"/>«Xiloy salo bolla paallizay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:26">izi ba qefeza dugeha miccizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:26">ne erateththanee?<verse eid="JOB 39:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27"/>Golley pude ke7idi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:27">dhoqqasohon ba keeth keexxizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:27">ne azaziinee?<verse eid="JOB 39:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28"/>Golley zaallata giddon aqees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:28">kelka giddon ba keeth keexxees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:28">zaallatikka izas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:28">qotettizaso gideettes.<verse eid="JOB 39:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29"/>Heen uttidi baas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:29">miza miish xeellees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:29">iza ayfetikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:29">haakon dizaaz demmeettes.<verse eid="JOB 39:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30"/>Hayssa malan golleti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:30">mizaazi dizaso shiiqeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:30">istta ciyetikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:30">suuth uyeettes» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:28">Mato 24:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:37">Luqa 17:37</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 39:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1"/>Qasseka Xoossi Iyoobes,<verse eid="JOB 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2"/>«Iyoobee! Asi Ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">Dandayza Xoossara marshettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">laththana nees misatizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">Tanara Xoossara marshettizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">nena gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">ane taas zaara» gides.<verse eid="JOB 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3"/>Iyoobi zaaridi,<verse eid="JOB 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4"/>«Godoo! Tani aykko maaddontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">laafa asa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">hannife guye ta kushen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">ta doona gordada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">co7u guussafe attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">nees ta zaarana zaaroy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">taas deenna.<verse eid="JOB 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5"/>Tani issito gaanayssa gadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">gido attiin taas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">zaariza miishshi baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">hayssafe guye ubbaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">ta haasaykke» gides.<verse eid="JOB 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6"/>Hessafe guye GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:6">gote carko giddon gididi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:6">Iyoobes hizgides,<verse eid="JOB 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7"/>«Ane adde gidikko dendada gixeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">ta oychchizayssa taas zaara.<verse eid="JOB 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8"/>Tana pirda geellasizaade kessada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:8">nena xillo as kessanaas dafettay?<verse eid="JOB 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9"/>Xoossa wolqqa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">mino wolqqay nees dizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">Xoossa qaala gunththa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">ne qaalay guummanawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">dandayzee?<verse eid="JOB 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10"/>Hessa mala gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">ane ne bonchchoninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">ne gitateththan denda!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">Ne teemateththinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">gitateththa may7a.<verse eid="JOB 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11"/>Otoranchchata beyada kawushsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:11">ne hanqoza istta bolla guussa.<verse eid="JOB 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12"/>Ane lo7eththa xeellada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:12">otoranchchata ubbaa yeellachcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:12">iita ooththizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:12">istti dizason heen dhayssa.<verse eid="JOB 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13"/>Istta ubbaa moogo may7on xaaxada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:13">issi bolla duufon mooga.<verse eid="JOB 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14"/>Hessafe guye neni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:14">ne wolqqan xoonizayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:14">tani nees markkattana.<verse eid="JOB 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15"/>«Tani nena medhdhidayssaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">Horiqe geetettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">do7a medhdhadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">izikka boora mala maata mees.<figure style="fig" alt="Hippopotamus" file="BK00026B.TIF" size="span" ref="40:15">Horiqe</figure><verse eid="JOB 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16"/>Izas xeessan diza wolqqa beya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:16">izas ulo giddon diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:16">shaya minoteththa xeella.<verse eid="JOB 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17"/>Izas goynay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">Libaanoose ziga miththa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">sitti gidayssa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">izas gedaa xaphotikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">minonne ordeta.<verse eid="JOB 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18"/>Iza meqeththatikka xarqimalanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:18">birata marco mala minota.<verse eid="JOB 40:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19"/>Ta medhdhida medheta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">ubbaafe wolqqama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">taappe attiin iza xoonanay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">haray deenna.<verse eid="JOB 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20"/>Wora do7ati ubbay kaa7iza zumay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:20">izas miza miish mokisees.<verse eid="JOB 40:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21"/>Kuway diza miththa garsan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">maqqa giddoninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">haaththi dizaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">care giddon ichchees.<verse eid="JOB 40:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22"/>Kuway diza miththati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:22">iza bantta kuwan genththeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:22">shaafa doonan dicciza miththati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:22">iza kammeettes.<verse eid="JOB 40:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23"/>Shaafa haaththa kixas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">izi dagammenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">Yordaanoose shaafay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">keehi kumidi goggiinkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">izi yayyenna.<verse eid="JOB 40:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24"/>Iza ayfeta toyssidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:24">iza oykkana asi dizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:24">iza siidhekka dafon qachchidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:24">iza oykkanaas dandayzay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 40:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1"/>«Neni lewataane geetettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">abba giddon diza do7a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">mole oykkiza manxakon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">oykkanaas dandayay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">Woykko iza inxarsaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">wodoron qachchanaas dandayay?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:14">Maza 74:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:26">104:26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:1">Isa 27:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2"/>Iza siidhezan dafo aaththada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:2">woykko iza gacoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:2">manxakon gelththada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:2">oykkanaas dandayay?<verse eid="JOB 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3"/>Izi, ‹Tana maararkkii!› gi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">nena woossanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">Woykko lo7o qaalan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">nena oychchandee?<verse eid="JOB 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4"/>Nees mernaas aylle gididi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:4">nees ooththanawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:4">izi nees qaala gelanee?<verse eid="JOB 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5"/>Asara meeze kafo mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">ne iza nenara meezesanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">Woykko nees macca nayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">kaassana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">ne qachcha woththanee?<verse eid="JOB 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6"/>Mole zal7anchchati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">iza shammanawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">miishshan marshettanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">Woykko qanxxereththidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">iza banttas gishettanee?<verse eid="JOB 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7"/>Iza galbakka ne koyidasora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">tooran cadda daakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">dandayay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">Woykko iza hu7eza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">hoxe miishshan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">cadda lukkanawu dandayay?<verse eid="JOB 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8"/>Ane neni iza dandayana gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">kushen bochcha!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">Izara ne baaxetida baaxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">wodenawukka balakka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">nam7anththo izara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">ne baaxetanaas kajjalakka.<verse eid="JOB 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9"/>Lewataane geetettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">abba giddo do7ara baaxetidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">iza xoonana kajjalos</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">dhaley deenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">iza be7iza ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">babon kokkorees.<verse eid="JOB 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10"/>Iza bolla meto gaththana guussi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:10">hessa keena deexo gidikko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:10">histtiin tanara eqettanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:10">xalizaadey izi baas oonee?<verse eid="JOB 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11"/>Saloppe garsan diza miishshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">wurikka taassa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">histtiin ta izas zaarana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">taas tal7iday oonee?<verse eid="JOB 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12"/>Lewataane geetettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">abba do7a gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">iza mino wolqqa gishshassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">izas lo7iza bolla gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">ta qonccisontta aggike.<verse eid="JOB 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13"/>Orde gidida iza galba shooqanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:13">woykko iza banqila poqqanawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:13">dandayzay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14"/>Keehi yashissiza achchati diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:14">iza banqilata pooqqana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:14">dandayzay oonee?<verse eid="JOB 41:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15"/>Izas zokko galbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:15">maarara uttida gondalleta mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:15">addafe shiddi oykettidayta.<verse eid="JOB 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16"/>Istti issoy issaara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:16">shiphi gida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:16">Istta giddora haray attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:16">carkoyka aadhdhenna.<verse eid="JOB 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17"/>Istti ubbayka issoy issaara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">oyketti uttida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">ay miishshika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">istta shaakkanawu dandayenna.<verse eid="JOB 41:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18"/>Izi dhishiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">xoxolqu giza poo7oy beettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">iza ayfetikka wontta maalado</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">arshe mala poo7eettes.<verse eid="JOB 41:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19"/>Iza doonappe tama lacoy kezees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:19">tamaa pinxeththika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:19">laalettishe beettes.<verse eid="JOB 41:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20"/>Penttiza disttey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">uttida coocen diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">afiray cuwattiza mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">iza siidheppe cuway</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">kezishe beettes.<verse eid="JOB 41:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21"/>Izi shempiza shemppoza seelay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:21">xiixinththa oyseththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:21">tama lacoykka iza doonappe kezees.<verse eid="JOB 41:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22"/>Iza morgen wolqqay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:22">kumida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:22">iza sinththay yashissees.<verse eid="JOB 41:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23"/>Iza ashoy dila7a gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:23">iza bollay birata mala minnees.<verse eid="JOB 41:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24"/>Izas tiray shuchcha mala mino;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:24">gaacciza woxa malakka mino.<verse eid="JOB 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25"/>Ha do7azi dendiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:25">wolqqamati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:25">attontta babon kokkoreettes.<verse eid="JOB 41:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26"/>Ay mashshaninne tooran</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">woykko wondafeninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">caddizaazan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">iza istti caddikokka xoonettenna.<verse eid="JOB 41:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27"/>Izi birata maqa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">menththereththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">Xarqimalakka musa miththa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">tiifereththees.<verse eid="JOB 41:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28"/>Iza bolla wondafe xongikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:28">izi yayyidi baqatenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:28">Yanbarsha shuchchika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:28">iza sinththan ishina mala.<verse eid="JOB 41:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29"/>Koxe maata mala qoodees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:29">asi iza bolla toora xongishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:29">qidhe miich miiccees.<verse eid="JOB 41:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30"/>Izas ulo galba hanchchazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:30">izi urqqa giddora bishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:30">biitta maarasha mala bookkees.<verse eid="JOB 41:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31"/>Abba haaththa pentta mala pocisees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:31">oton penttiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:31">zayte mala podhisees.<verse eid="JOB 41:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32"/>Izi aadhdhi biza ogey poo7isees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:32">abba haaththaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:32">hoomo coppu histtees.<verse eid="JOB 41:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33"/>Izi yash erontta medheta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:33">biitta bolla iza misatiza medhetay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:33">mulekka deenna.<verse eid="JOB 41:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34"/>Keehi gita gidida medhetatakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:34">izi kadhees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:34">izi do7a ubbaa bolla kawo.»<verse eid="JOB 41:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoobi Bana Kawushshides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1"/>Hayssafe guyen Iyoobi Xoossas hizgi zaarides;<verse eid="JOB 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2"/>«Ta Godawu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">Neni ubba miish ooththanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">dandayzayssa ta eradis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">ne qofaakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">dhuphi digganay deenna.<verse eid="JOB 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3"/>Ta erizaara keehi guuth gidishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">ta daro haasayzayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">aazas gididaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">ne oychchadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">tumukka tani eronttayssanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">akeekontta ubbaa haasayadis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:2">Iyo 38:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4"/>‹Ta oyshaa ezga siyada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">taas zaaro imma› gadasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:3">Iyo 38:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5"/>Ta hanno gakkanaas ne gishshas erizayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:5">asappe siyoyssan xalla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:5">ha7i gidikko ta ayfetan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:5">ta nena beyadis.<verse eid="JOB 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6"/>Hessafe dendidayssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">ta haasayda miishshati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">tana yeellachchida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">bidinththaninne gudullan uttada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">ta neeppe maarettana.»<verse eid="JOB 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuushsha Qofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7"/>Xoossi Iyoobera haytantta ubbaa haasayettidaappe guye Temaane dere as Elfaazes, «Intte ta aylle Iyoobe mala ta gishshas likke haasayontta gishshas tani ne bollanne ne laggeta bolla hanqettadis. <verse eid="JOB 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8"/>Hessa gishshas ha7i laappun wofanotanne laappun dharshota ekkidi ta oosanchcha Iyoobekko biite. Heen intte nagara gishshas xuugettiza yarsho shiishshite. Ta oosanchcha Iyoobi inttes woossana; tanikka iza woosa siyada inttena intte nagara mala qaxxaykke. Intte taas Iyoobe mala lo7o miish haasaybeekketa» gides.<verse eid="JOB 42:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9"/>Hessafe guye Temaane dere as Elfaazey, Shuha dere as Belidaadinne Na7imaane dere as Zoofaarey biidi Xoossi istta azazida mala ooththida. Xoossika Iyoobe woosa siyides.<verse eid="JOB 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10"/>Iyoobi ba heedzdzu laggetas woossidaappe guye Xoossi izi zaari durettana mala ooththides. Kase izas dizayssafe aaththidi dakko izas immides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:1-3">Iyo 1:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11"/>He wode Iyoobe ishati, iza michchetinne kase iza erizayti ubbay iza beyanaas yida. Izara issife izason kath mida; istti izas mishettizayssa qonccisidi Xoossi iza bolla gaththida metoza gishshas iza minththeththida. Issoy issoy birappenne worqqafe oosettida midiga izas imota immida. <verse eid="JOB 42:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12"/>Xoossi Iyoobes wurseththa de7oza koyroyssafe aaththi anjjides. Hessa gishshas Iyoobes 14,000 dorsi, 6,000 gaamellati, 1,000 waaththa boorati, 1,000 macca hareti deettes. <verse eid="JOB 42:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13"/>Qasseka laappun attuma naytanne heedzdzu macca nayta zaari yelides. <verse eid="JOB 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14"/>Macca naytappe koyroro Yimima, nam7anththayo Qexi7o, heedzdzanththoyo Qerene-Hafiko giidi sunththides. <verse eid="JOB 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15"/>Biitta bolla Iyoobe macca nayta mala medha lo7o maccay beettibeenna. Istta aaway isttas istta ishatara biitta laattana mala shaakki immides.<verse eid="JOB 42:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16"/>Hessafe guye Iyoobi 140 de7ides. Ba nayta oydanththo yeleta gakkanaas be7ides. <verse eid="JOB 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17"/>Iyoobi daro layth diidi lo7o cima cimmidi hayqqides.<verse eid="JOB 42:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42"/>
</usx>
